<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">RRK42.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">MAKO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Engiri Nk'oku Yaahandiikirwe Mako</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mako</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mak</para>
  <para style="mt2">ENGIRI NK'OKU YAAHANDIIKIRWE</para>
  <para style="mt1">MAKO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Okutandika kw'engiri ya Yesu Kristo, Omwana wa Ruhanga: <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2-8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-30">Yoh 1:19-30</ref>. </char></note> nk'oku kyahandiikirwe omu kitabo kya nabi Isaaya, ngu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">Reeba, nintuma entumwa yangye, ekubandize;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">Niyo erishemeza omuhanda gwawe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa 40:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eiraka ry'orikugambira omu ihamba, ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">Mushemeze omuhanda gwa Mukama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">Mugorore otuhanda twe.<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yohaana okuhikiiriza ebyaragwirwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Yohaana akaija naabatiza omu ihamba, naabuurira okubatizibwa kw'okweteisa ahabw'okwihwaho ebibi. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Abantu b'omu ishaza rya Buyudaaya ryona n'aba Yerusaalemu boona baaruga owaabo, baamushangayo; yaababatiriza omu mugyera Yorudani, nibaatura ebibi byabo. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:8">2 Bag 1:8</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Yohaana akaba ajwara ekijwaro ky'ebyoya by'engamira, ayezirikisa orukoba omunda, eby'okurya bye bikaba biri enzigye n'obwoki bw'omu ishwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Yaabagambira, naagira ati: orikwija enyima yangye nankiza obushoboorozi; tinshemereire kwinama kuyuzya enkoba z'enkaito ze. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Nyowe naababatiza n'amaizi, kwonka We aryababatiza n'Omwoyo Orikwera.<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okubatizibwa Yohaana, n'okwohibwa Sitaane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:9-11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:31-34">Yoh 1:31-34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu buri ebyo Yesu akaruga Nazareesi ey'omuri Galilaaya, yaija, yaabatizibwa Yohaana omuri Yorudani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Ahonaaho ku yaabaire naaruga omu maizi, yaareeba eiguru rikinguukire, n'Omwoyo naamushuumaho nk'enkombe, <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:7">Mak 9:7</ref>. </char></note> n'eiraka ryayema omu iguru riti: Niiwe Mwana wangye ou nkunda, kandi ou nshemerererwa munonga.<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:12-13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luk 4:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat 4:1-11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahonaaho Omwoyo yaamutwara omu ihamba; <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />yaamarayo ebiro makumi ana, naayohibwa Sitaane; yaaguma hamwe n'enyamaishwa, baamaraika nibamuheereza.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:14-15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 4:14">Luk 4:14</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 4:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat 4:12-17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Yohaana, ku yaaherize kukwatwa, Yesu yaija Galilaaya naabuurira engiri ya Ruhanga, naagira ati: <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Obunaku buhikire; obukama bwa Ruhanga bwiriire haihi; mweteise, mwikirize engiri.<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okutoorana abeegi ab'okubanza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:16-20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk 5:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4:18-22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku yaabaire naaraba aha rubaju rw'enyanja ya Galilaaya, yaareeba Simooni na Anderea omurumuna nibatega obutimba omu nyanja, ahakuba bakaba bari abajubi. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yesu yaabagira ati: Mwije munkuratire, naanye ndyabahindura abajubi b'abantu. <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Ahonaaho baatsigaho obutimba bwabo, baamukuratira. <verse eid="MRK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Ku yairiire omu maisho hakye, yaareeba Yakobo mwene Zebedaayo na Yohaana omurumuna, abaabaire bari omu bwato, nibashumikanisa obutimba. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Ahonaaho yaabeeta; baatsiga ishebo Zebedaayo omu bwato hamwe n'abapakasi, baamukuratira.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okukiza owaabaire ariho daimoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:21-28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luk 4:31-37</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baataaha Kaperenaumu; ahari Sabato yaataaha omuri <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sinagogi n'ekanisa y'ekiyudaaya. </char></note>sinagogi, ahonaaho yaayegyesa. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Baatangaarira okwegyesa kwe, ahakuba akabeegyesa nk'oine obushoboorozi weena, kunu ti nk'abahandiiki. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Omuri egyo sinagogi hakaba harimu omuntu owaabaire ariho daimoni; ahonaaho yaaborooga naagira ati: <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:7">Mat 5:7</ref>. </char></note> Noofa ki naitwe, iwe Yesu owa Nazareesi? Oizire kutucwekyereza? Ninkumanya, ori Orikwera wa Ruhanga. <verse eid="MRK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Yesu yaamugambira kubi, naagira ati: Hunama! Murugyeho. <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:26">Mak 9:26</ref>. </char></note> Daimoni yaamuteera ahansi, yaamutetemya, yaaborooga n'eiraka rihango, yaamurugaho. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Boona baatangaara, nibabuuzana bati: Eki n'enki? Oku n'okwegyesa kusya! Naaragiira baadaimoni n'obushoboorozi, nabo bamuhurira. <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Ahonaaho okurangaanwa kwe kwahika hoonahoona embaju zoona eziri haihi na Galilaaya.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okukiza nyinazaara wa Simooni n'abandi barwaire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:29-34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4:38-41</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 8:14-16">Mat 8:14-16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahonaaho ku yaashohoire omuri sinagogi, yaagyenda na Yakobo na Yohaana, baataaha omu nju ya Simooni na Anderea; <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />kandi nyinazaara wa Simooni akaba abyami arwaire omushwija; ahonaaho baamugambira oku ari; <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />yaija, yaamukwata aha mukono, yaamwimutsya, omushwija gwamurugaho, yaimuka, yaabaheereza. <verse eid="MRK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Omu mwabazyo ogwo, eizooba nirirengarenga, baamureetera boona abaabaire barwaire n'abandi abaabaire bariho baadaimoni. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Abantu boona ab'omuri tauni baateeranira omu irembo. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:17">Byak 16:17</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 16:18">18</ref>. </char></note> Yaakiza baingi abaabaire barwaire endwara z'emiringo mingi; yaabinga baadaimoni baingi, kandi tiyaabaikiriza kugamba, ahakuba bakamumanya.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okugyenda naabuurira engiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:35-39: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luk 4:42-44</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha kiro ekindi akaimuka bukiri nyekiro, yaashohora, yaaza omu mwanya ogwekiikire, yaashabirayo. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Simooni na bagyenzi be baamukurata. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Ku baamuboine, baamugira bati: Abantu boona nibakusherura. <verse eid="MRK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Yaabagarukamu ati: Tugyende ahandi omuri tauni eziri haihi, nayo mbuurireyo; ahakuba nikyo naiziriire. <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Yaagyenda omuri Galilaaya yoona, naabuurira omuri sinagogi zaabo, kandi naabinga baadaimoni.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okukiza omubembe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:40-45: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 8:2-4">Mat 8:2-4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima omubembe yaija ah'ari, yaamweshengyereza, amutsimbire amaju, yaamugira ati: Ku oraabe nookunda, noobaasa kunshemeza. <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yaamusaasira, yaagorora omukono gwe, yaamukoraho, yaamugira ati: Ninkunda; shemera! <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Ahonaaho ebibembe byamurugaho, yaashemezibwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Yaamwohereza ahonaaho, naamwehanangiriza munonga, <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:2-32">Lev 14:2-32</ref>. </char></note> yaamuragiira ati: Reeba, otagira ou waagambira; kwonka irooko ogyende, oyeyorekye aha munyamurwa, oheyo ebi Musa yaaragiire ahabw'okuba oshemeziibwe, bibe eby'okuhamya omu maisho g'abantu. <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Kwonka we ku yaashohoire, yaatandika kubigamba, naabibuzya omu bantu; okuruga aho Yesu tarabaasize kugaruka omuri tauni butunu, yaaguma omu ihamba; abantu baaruga oku n'oku, baamushangayo.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu okukiza ozingazingirwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1-12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5:17-26</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9:1-8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku haahingwireho ebiro bikye, Yesu yaagaruka Kaperenaumu, kyamanywa ku ari owaabo. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Abantu baingi baateeranira omu nju, baagiijura, omwanya gwabura nangwa n'aha muryango; yaabagambira ekigambo kya Ruhanga. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Ku yaabaire naakigamba, haija abantu bana bamureeteire omuntu ozingazingirwe, bamuheekire omu ngozi. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Ku baabuzire ah'okuraba kuhika ahari Yesu ahabw'omutwe gw'abantu, baakambura aha mutwe gw'enju aharinganiire n'ahu Yesu yaabaire ari; ku baaherize kuhakambura, baashuumizaho ozingazingirwe omu ngozi, ei yaabaire arimu. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Yesu ku yaareebire okwikiriza kwabo, yaagira ozingazingirwe ati: Mwana wangye, ebibi byawe byakusaasirwa. <verse eid="MRK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Kwonka aha rubaju hakaba hashutamiho abamwe aha bahandiiki, baatandika kwetomboita nibeebuuza omu mitima yaabo bati: <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />Beitu shi, omuntu ogu ekirikumugambisa kityo n'enki? Naarogota! N'oha orikubaasa kusaasira ebibi kureka Ruhanga wenka? <verse eid="MRK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Ahonaaho Yesu, ku yaamanyire omu mwoyo gwe okwetomboita kw'omu mitima yaabo, yaababuuza ati: Nimwetomboitera ki mutyo omu mitima yaanyu? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Ekirikurahuka ni kiiha, okugira ozingazingirwe nti, Ebibi byawe byakusaasirwa; nari okugira nti, Imuka oyekorere engozi yaawe, ogyende? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Kwonka mumanye ngu Omwana w'omuntu aine obushoboorozi aha nsi okusaasira ebibi, yaahindukira ozingazingirwe yaamugira ati: <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />Ninkuragiira nti: Imuka oyekorere engozi yaawe, otaahe. <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Yaimuka, ahonaaho yaayekorera engozi ye, yaashohora omu maisho gaabo boona; kyabatangaaza boona, baahimbisa Ruhanga nibagira bati: Eki tikikareebwaga!<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okweta Leevi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:13-17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5:27-32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9:9-13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaagaruka yaagyenda aha rubaju rw'enyanja; omutwe gw'abantu gwamuteeraniraho, yaabeegyesa. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Bwanyima yaagumizamu, yaareeba Leevi mwene Alifaayo, ashutami omu ihoorezo, yaamugira ati: Nkuratira! Yaimuka, yaamukuratira.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Kandi Yesu ku yaabaire ashutami omwa Leevi naarya, abahooza baingi n'abasiisi baashutama hamwe nawe n'abeegi be; ahakuba abaabaire bamukuratiire bakaba bari baingi. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Abahandiiki b'Abafarisaayo, ku baareebire naarya n'abahooza n'abasiisi, baabuuza abeegi be bati: Ahabw'enki naarya kandi naanywa n'abahooza n'abasiisi? <verse eid="MRK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yesu ku yaabihuriire, yaabagarukamu ati: Abahuriire tibeetenga mufumu, kureka abarwaire; tindaizire kweta bahikiriire, kureka abasiisi.<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'okwesiibyakwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:18-22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 5:33-38">Luk 5:33-38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9:14-17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo abeegi ba Yohaana n'Abafarisaayo bakaba nibeesiibyakwo; abantu baija baamubuuza bati: Ahabw'enki abeegi ba Yohaana n'ab'Abafarisaayo beesiibyakwo, haza kunu abaawe bo bateesiibyakwo? <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yesu yaabagarukamu ati: Abakwe babaasa bata kwesiibyakwo bakiine kishwera? Ku baba bakiri hamwe nawe, tibeesiibyakwo. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Kwonka obunaku buryahika, kishwera aryabaihwaho; obwo nibwo baryesiibyakwo. <verse eid="MRK 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Tihariho muntu oteera ekiremu ky'omwenda musya aha mwenda ogukuzire; ku yaakukora atyo, ekiremu ekisya kikaataagura omwenda omukuru, n'ekifumuka kihanguha. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Kandi tihariho muntu oshuka viinyo y'omutahe omu furebe z'empu ezikuzire; ku yaakukora atyo, viinyo ekaabarura efurebe, viinyo egyo eyatika, n'efurebe zisiisikara; kureka viinyo y'omutahe eshukwa omu furebe nsya.<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebya Sabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:23-28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12:1-8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obundi akaba naaraba omu misiri y'oburo aha izooba rya Sabato; abeegi be baagyenda nibacwa obushiisha bw'oburo. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Abafarisaayo baamubuuza bati: Reeba, ahabw'enki abeegi baawe nibakora ekirikuzira, okucwa obushiisha aha izooba rya Sabato? <verse eid="MRK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Yaabagarukamu ati: Beitu shi, timukashomaga eki Daudi yaakozire, obu yaabaire ashobeirwe, aine enjara, we n'abu yaabaire aine? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Sam 21:1-6</ref>. </char></note> Omu biro ebi Abiasaari yaabaire ari omunyamurwa omukuru, Daudi akataaha omu nju ya Ruhanga, yaarya aha migaati ey'okumurikwa, yaagaruka yaahaho n'abu yaabaire aine, eki Ebiragiro byabaire bizibira omuntu weena kukora, kureka abanyamurwa bonka. <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Yaabagambira ati: Sabato ekateebwaho ahabw'abantu; kwonka ti bantu ahabwa Sabato. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />N'ahabw'ekyo Omwana w'omuntu niwe Mukama wa Sabato nayo.<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu okukiza omuntu okokootsire omukono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1-6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6:6-11</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12:9-14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obundi akagaruka yaataaha omuri sinagogi; yaashangamu omushaija okokootsire omukono. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Baaguma bamutaireho amaisho kureeba yaaba araamukize ahari Sabato, ngu baihe aho bamuregye. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yaaragiira omushaija owaabaire akokootsire omukono, ati: Yemerera ahagati aho. <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Yaababuuza ati: N'eky'Ebiragiro okukora gye ahari Sabato, nari okukora kubi? Okukiza amagara g'omuntu, nari okugahwerekyereza? Baahunama kwonka. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:33">Yoh 11:33</ref>. </char></note> Yaababunzyamu amaisho aine ekiniga, agwirwe kubi ahabw'obugangaazi bw'omu mitima yaabo, yaaragiira omushaija ogwo, ati: Nanuura omukono gwawe. Yaagunanuura, gwakira. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:16">Mat 22:16</ref>. </char></note> Ahonaaho Abafarisaayo baashohora, baahanuura n'aba Heroode oku baraamwite.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7-12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luk 6:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:15">Mat 12:15</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 12:16">16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Yesu n'abeegi be baarugayo, baaza aha nyanja; omutwe muhango gw'abantu, abaarugire Galilaaya, baamukuratira; kandi n'abandi baingi munonga ab'omuri Buyudaaya, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />n'aba Yerusaalemu, n'aba Idumaaya, n'aba seeri ya Yorudani, n'abaabaire batwire haihi na Tuuro na Sidoni, ku baahuriire byona ebi yaakozire, baija ah'ari. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Yaagambira abeegi be kumureetera obwato haihi ahabw'omutwe gw'abantu, ngu barekye kumufunza; <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />ahakuba akaba akirize baingi, n'ahabw'ekyo boona abaabaire baine endwara baamigana ngu bakaamukoraho, bakira. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Kandi na baadaimoni, ku baabaire bamureeba, bagwa omu maisho ge, nibaborooga, nibagira bati: Ori Omwana wa Ruhanga. <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Kwonka We yaabeehanangiriza ku bareka kumubuzya omu bantu.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okutoorana entumwa 12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:13-19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10:1-4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi yaatemba ekibungo, yaayeta abu yaayenzire, baija ahu yaabaire ari. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Yaihamu ikumi na babiri kuguma nawe, ngu agume abatume kubuurira engiri, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />kandi ngu abahe obushoboorozi bw'okubinga baadaimoni; <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Simooni yaamweta eiziina Petero, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />na Yakobo mwene Zebedaayo na Yohaana murumuna wa Yakobo, yaabeeta Boanerege, amakuru gaaryo ngu Abaana b'okuhinda; <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />na Anderea, Filipo Batolomaayo na Matayo, Tomasi, Yakobo mwene Alifaayo, Tadaayo, Simooni Omukananaayo, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />na Yuda Iskaryota owaamureebize.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'okujuma Omwoyo Orikwera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Bwanyima yaataaha owaabo; omutwe gw'abantu gwayeyongyera kuteerana, n'ahabw'ekyo Yesu n'abeegi be tibaabaasa n'okurya. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:20">Yoh 10:20</ref>. </char></note> Kandi abaabo ku baakihuriire, baashohora kumukwata, ahabw'okuba bakagira ngu, Agwire eiraro. <verse eid="MRK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 11:15-22">Luk 11:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:24-32">Mat 12:24-32</ref>. </char></note> Kandi abahandiiki, abashuumire nibaruga Yerusaalemu, baagira bati: Ariho <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Beelzebuli n'eiziina ry'orikwetwa “Omutegyeki w'ensi egi”, niwe Sitaane. </char></note>Belezebuli; kandi omukama wa baadaimoni niwe arikumubingisa baadaimoni. <verse eid="MRK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Yaabeeta, yaabacwera enfumu, ati: Sitaane naabaasa ata kubinga Sitaane? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Obugabe bwona, ku bwebaganisamu, obugabe obwo tibubaasa kugumaho. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />N'enju yoona ku eyebaganisamu, enju egyo teebaasa kugumaho. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Kandi na Sitaane ku araabe naayerwanisa, akeebaganisamu, tarikubaasa kugumaho, kureka naahwaho. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Hoona tihariho muntu orikubaasa kutaaha omu nju y'ondi ow'amaani kunyaga ebintu bye, atabandize kuboha ogwo ow'amaani, bwanyima akabona kunyaga eby'omu nju ye. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Abantu baryasaasirwa ebibi byabo byona, na buri kurogota kwona; <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />kwonka weena orirogota aha Mwoyo Orikwera tarisaasirwa na kakye, ahakuba aryaba akwatsirwe orubanja rw'ekibi ky'ebiro n'ebiro. <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Eki yaabagambiriire atyo, n'ahabw'okuba bakagira ntu, Ariho daimoni.<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Beene waabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:31-35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8:19-21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12:46-50</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi hakaija nyina na beene waabo, baamutumaho kumweta, beemereire aheeru. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Omutwe gw'abantu abaabaire bashutami bamwehinguririize, baamugira bati: Reeba, nyoko na beene waanyu bari aheeru nibakweta. <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Yaabagarukamu ati: Maawe na beene waitu nibaahi? <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Yaabuzya amaisho omuri abo abaabaire bashutami bamwehinguririize, naagira ati: Reeba, maawe na beene waitu n'aba bari aha! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Weena okora ebi Ruhanga akunda, niwe murumuna wangye, niwe munyaanyazi, kandi niwe maawe.<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Enfumu y'omubibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1-20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 8:4-15">Luk 8:4-15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:1-28">Mat 13:1-28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi akagaruka yaatandika kwegyeseza aha rubaju rw'enyanja. Omutwe gw'abantu baingi munonga gwamuteeraniraho, n'ahabw'ekyo yaaza omu bwato, yaabushutamamu omu nyanja, n'abantu abo boona baashutama aha nkungu. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Yaabeegyesa bingi omu nfumu omu kwegyesa kwe, yaabagambira naagira ati: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />Mutegye amatu, muhurire! <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Omubibi akashohora kubiba. Ku yaabaire naabiba, embibo ezimwe zaagwa omu muhanda; enyonyi zaija zaazitorotoora. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Embibo ezindi zaagwa aha rukiri ahataine itaka ringi; ahonaaho zaamera, ahabw'eitaka kutaba ringi; <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />eizooba ku ryajwire, omushana gwaziteera, zaahonga; kandi ahabw'okutagira mizi, zaayoma. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Embibo ezindi zaagwa omu mahwa; amahwa gaamera, gaazinyuruza, tizaayera. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Embibo ezindi zaagwa omu itaka rirungi; ku zaaherize kumera, zaakura gye, zaakanya, zaayera, ezimwe zaahitsya makumi ashatu, ezindi makumi mukaaga, n'ezindi igana. <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Kandi yaagira ati: Oine amatu agarikuhurira, ahurire.<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Kandi ku yaabaire ari wenka, abo abaabaire bamwehinguririize hamwe na bari ikumi na babiri baamubuuza aha nfumu egyo. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Yaabagira ati: Imwe muhairwe okumanya emibonano y'obukama bwa Ruhanga, kwonka ab'aheeru bo byona babicwerwa omu nfumu, <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Isa 6:9</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 6:10">10</ref>. </char></note> ngu okureeba kwo bareebe, kwonka barekye kwetegyereza, kandi okuhurira kwo bahurire, kwonka barekye kushoborokyerwa, ngu batakaahinduka bakasaasirwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Yaabagira ati: Timurikumanya enfumu egi? Mbwenu shi, muryamanya muta enfumu zoona? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Omubibi abiba ekigambo. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Embibo ez'omu muhanda, ahi ekigambo kyabibirwe, abo nibo baheza kuhurira, ahonaaho Sitaane akaija, akabaihamu ekigambo ekyabibwa omuribo. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Kandi ezaabibirwe aha rukiri, abo nibo bahurira ekigambo, bakarahuka kukiikiriza n'okushemererwa; <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />ahabw'okushangwa bataine mizi ehamire, beehangaana omwanya mukye; bwanyima hakibaho obusaasi n'okuhiigwa nibaturwa ekyo kigambo, ahonaaho bagwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />N'ezo ezaagwire omu mahwa, nibo bahurira ekigambo; <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:23">Mak 10:23</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 10:24">24</ref>. </char></note> kwonka amaganya g'ensi, n'okubeihwabeihwa kw'obutungi bwayo, n'okwetenga ebindi, ku bikijwangamu, byanyuruza ekyo kigambo, kibura kwana. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Kwonka ezaabibirwe aha itaka rirungi, abo nibo bahurira ekigambo, bakakiikiriza, bakaana ebyana emirundi makumi ashatu, makumi mukaaga, na igana.<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Enfumu ezindi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:21-25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luk 8:16-18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi yaabagambira ati: Etabaaza ereetwa kujuumikirwa ekiibo, nari shi okugita omunda y'ekitanda? Tereetwa kuteebwa aha kikondo kyayo? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:2">Luk 12:2</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba tihaine kyasherekirwe ekitaribonwa, nari eky'omubonano ekitarireebwa butunu. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Oine amatu agarikuhurira, ahurire. <verse eid="MRK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:2">Mat 7:2</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yaabagira ati: Mwerinde eki muhurira; endengo ei murengamu niyo murirengyerwamu, kandi muryayongyerwaho. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Ahakuba oine niwe aryongyerwa; kandi otaine aryayakwa n'ekyo eki aine.<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Kandi yaagira ati: Obukama bwa Ruhanga nibushusha nk'oku omuntu abiba embibo omu itaka; <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />akabyama kandi akaimuka nyomushana na nyekiro; embibo zikamera, zikakura, atamanyire oku zikuzire. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Eitaka niryo rimeza ryonka; habanza akababi, hataho obushiisha, na bwanyima enjuma nkuru. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:13">Yoel 3:13</ref>. </char></note> Ku biheza kwera, ahonaaho areeta omusyo, abigyesha, ahakuba eigyesha rihikire.<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:30-34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 13:18">Luk 13:18</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 13:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:31">Mat 13:31</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 13:32">32</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi yaagira ati: Mbwenu obukama bwa Ruhanga tukaabugyeranisa na ki? Nari tukaabushobooroza nfumu ki? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Nibushusha nk'akajuma ka <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sinaapi reeba Mat. 13:31. </char></note>sinaapi. Ku kabibwa omu itaka, kaba kari kakye okukira embibo zoona eziri omu nsi; <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:12">Dan 4:12</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 4:21">21</ref>. </char></note> kwonka ku kaheza kubibwa, kamera, kakura, karugamu ekiti kihango okukira ebindi byona, kagira amataagi mahango, kandi n'enyonyi z'omu mwanya zaarika omu mataagi gaako.<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Akaba abagambira ekigambo omu nfumu nyingi, nk'oku baabaire babaasa kushoborokyerwa; <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />tarabaasize kubeegyesa atabirabize mu nfumu; kureka abeegi be nibo yaabaire ashobororera byona omu mubonano.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okucureeza enyanja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:35-41: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8:22-25</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 8:18">Mat 8:18</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">23-27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha izooba eryo ku bwabaire omu mwabazyo, yaabagira ati: Nimwije twambukye seeri. <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Ku baaherize kuraga omutwe gw'abantu, baamutwara omu bwato nk'oku yaabaire ari; kandi hakaba hariho n'agandi maato. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Eihunga ringi ryaija, ebingonzi byateera obwato, amaizi gaabusheeshekamu, bwaba haihi kwijura; <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />kwonka We akaba agwejegyeire, ayeeshegwire omushego enyima omu bwato. Baamusisiimura, baamugira bati: Mwegyesa, torikututaho mutima? Reeba twafa! <verse eid="MRK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Yaasisiimuka, yaakabukira eihunga, yaagambira enyanja ati: Reka, cureera! Eihunga ryacureera; haabaho obucureera bwingi. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Yaababuuza ati: N'enki ekirikubatiinisa? Timukagizire kwikiriza? <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Baatiina munonga, baagambirana bati: Bantu 'mwe, ogu ni muntu ki, orikuragiira eihunga n'enyanja, bikamuhurira!<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu okubinga baadaimoni aha muntu wa Geraseene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1-21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 8:26-40">Luk 8:26-40</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8:28-34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi baahika seeri y'enyanja omu nsi y'Abageraseene. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Ku yaarugire ati omu bwato, yaabuganwa omuntu owaabaire naaruga omu bituuro ariho daimoni. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Omushaija ogwo akaba atuura omu bituuro, kandi tihariho muntu owaabaire naakibaasa kumuboha, nangwa n'obu yaakuba n'emihama; <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />ahakuba emirundi mingi bakaba bamubohesa emirunga n'emihama; emihama agihendagura, n'emirunga agicwa; tihaine muntu owaabaire agira amaani g'okumucureeza. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Obutwire bwona nyomushana na nyekiro akaba ayamuriza omu bituuro n'omu bibungo naayeshaza amabaare. <verse eid="MRK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Ku yaareebire Yesu akiri hare, yairuka yaamuramya; <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />naayamuza n'eiraka rihango, naagira ati: Noofa ki naanye, Yesu Omwana wa Ruhanga Rukira-boona? Ninkurahiza Ruhanga, otaanyita kubi! <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Ahakuba Yesu akaba yaamuragiira ati: Murugyeho, iwe daimoni! <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Yesu yaamubuuza ati: Eiziina ryawe ori oha? Yaamugarukamu ati: Eiziina ryangye niinye <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ekigambo Legioni nikimanyisa omubaro mwingi munonga. </char></note>Legioni, ahabw'okuba turi baingi. <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Yaamweshengyereza munonga, ngu atababinga omu nsi omwo. <verse eid="MRK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Kandi omu rukiizi hakaba hariiriireyo omukumbi gw'empunu nyingi; <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />baadaimoni baamweshengyereza bati: Twohereze omu mpunu, tube nizo twataahamu. <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Yaabaikiriza. Baadaimoni baamurugaho, baazitaahamu; empunu ezo zikaba ziri nk'enkumi ibiri zaashuumira aha ibanga niziiruka, zaahwera omu nyanja.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Abariisa baazo bairuka, baabigambira ab'omuri tauni n'ab'omu maka; abantu baahurura, baija kureeba ekyabaho. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Ku baahikire ahari Yesu, baashangaho owaabaire ariho baadaimoni ashutami, ajwaire gye, aine obwengye bwe; baatiina. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Abariisa abaabireebire baabashobororera ebyaba ahari ogwo owaabaire ariho baadaimoni hamwe n'eby'empunu. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Baatandika kweshengyereza Yesu kubarugira omu nsi. <verse eid="MRK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Kandi ku yaabaire naagaruka omu bwato, owaabaire ariho baadaimoni yaamweshengyereza kuguma nawe. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />We yaamwangira, yaamugira ati: Irooko otaahe owaanyu omuri bagyenzi baawe, obagambire ebi Mukama akukoreire ku biri bikuru, n'oku akusaasiire. <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 7:31">Mak 7:31</ref>. </char></note> Yaagyenda, yaatandika kubuzya omuri Dekapooli ebi Yesu amukoreire, ku biri bikuru; abantu boona baatangaara.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okuhimbuura omwana wa Yairo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Yesu ku yaagarukire, yaayambukira omu bwato, yaahika seeri. Omutwe gw'abantu baingi gwateeranira ah'ari; kandi akaba ari haihi n'enyanja. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:22-43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:41-56">Luk 8:41-56</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9:18-26</ref>. </char></note> Haija omwe aha bakuru ba sinagogi, eiziina rye Yairo. Ku yaareebire Yesu, yaamukwata amaguru; <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />yaamweshengyereza, naagira ati: Kahara kangye naatsiga niguhiriita. Ija okateho engaro, kakire, kagire amagara. <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Yaagyenda nawe. Abantu baingi baamukuratira, baagyenda bamushagatiire.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okukiza omukazi owaabaire arwaire ekyejwiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Kandi hakaba hariho omukazi owaabaire amazire emyaka ikumi n'ebiri arwaire ekyejwiso, <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />naafa kubi munonga naaraguza omu bafumu baingi, yaamariireyo ebintu bye byona, kwonka atarikukira, kureka okweyongyera kurwara. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Ku yaahuriire ebya Yesu, yaija enyima ye omu mutwe gw'abantu, yaakora aha kijwaro kye; <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />ahakuba akahamya naagira ati: N'obu naakukora aha bijwaro bye, nkaakira. <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Ahonaaho ekyejwiso kye kyayoma; yaayehurira omu mubiri gwe ku yaakirira kimwe endwara ye. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:19">Luk 6:19</ref>. </char></note> Yesu, ku yaahuriire amaani gaamurugamu, ahonaaho yaahindukira omutwe gw'abantu, yaababuuza ati: N'oha owaakora aha kijwaro kyangye? <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Abeegi be baamugira bati: Nooreeba abantu baingi nibakumigisiriza, oti, Owankoraho n'oha! <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Yaababunzyamu amaisho kureeba owaakora ekyo. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Kwonka omukazi, ahabw'okumanya eki yaakorerwa, yaija aine obwoba naatetema, yaagwa ahansi omu maisho ge, yaamugambira amazima goona. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Yesu yaamugarukamu ati: Mwana wangye, okwikiriza kwawe nikwo kwakukiza, yegyendere n'obusingye, okirire kimwe endwara yaawe.<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />KU yaabaire naakigamba, haija abaaruga omu ka y'omukuru wa sinagogi, nibagira bati: Muhara waawe yaakaba; nooruhiza ki omwegyesa? <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Kwonka Yesu tiyaata mutima aha ki baagamba, yaagambira omukuru wa sinagogi ati: Otatiina, ikiriza kwonka. <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Kandi tiyaikiriza muntu weena kugyenda nawe, kureka Petero na Yakobo na Yohaana murumuna wa Yakobo. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Ku baahikire aha nju y'omukuru wa sinagogi, yaashangaho okucura, abantu nibarira nibaborooga. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:11">Yoh 11:11</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaataahiremu, yaabagira ati: N'enki ekirikubateeza orwari n'okubariza? Omwishiki tafiire, agwejegyeire. <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Baamushekyerera munonga. Kwonka ku yaaherize kubashohoza boona, yaatwara ishe w'omwishiki na nyina n'abu yaabaire aine, yaataahamu, yaahika ahu omwishiki yaabaire ari. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:14">Luk 7:14</ref>. </char></note> Yaamukwata aha mukono, yaamugira ati: Talisa-kuumi! Amakuru gaakyo ngu Mwishiki 'we, ninkugambira nti: Imuka. <verse eid="MRK 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Ahonaaho omwishiki ogwo yaimuka, yaagyenda; ahakuba akaba ahikize emyaka ikumi n'ebiri. Ahonaaho baagira okutangaara kwingi munonga. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Yaabeehanangiriza munonga, ngu hatagira owaakimanya; yaaragiira ku bamuha eby'okurya.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu okuhakanisibwa aba Nazareesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1-6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 4:15-30">Luk 4:15-30</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13:53-58</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaarugayo, yaagaruka omu kyanga ky'owaabo; abeegi be baamukuratira. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Sabato ku yaahikire, yaatandika kwegyesa omuri sinagogi; baingi ku baamuhuriire, baatangaara, nibagira bati: omushaija ogu akaiha hi ebi byona? Ni bwengye ki ogu obu yaahairwe? Ebi arikukora ka n'eby'okutangaaza! <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Beitu ogu t'omubaizi, omwana wa Mariamu, mukuru wa Yakobo na Yose na Yuda na Simooni? Na banyaanya tibari owaitu? Ebye byabashobera. <verse eid="MRK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Yesu yaabagira ati: Nabi weena tabura kitiinisa, kureka omu ihanga ryabo, n'omu ruganda rwabo, n'omu ka ye. <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />N'ahabw'ekyo tarabaasize kukorerayo ky'okutangaaza kyona, kureka akata engaro aha barwaire bakye, yaabakiza. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Yaatangaara ahabw'okutaikiriza kwabo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Bwanyima yaagyendagyenda omu birorero, naayegyesa.<verse eid="MRK 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okutuma abeegi be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:7-13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:1">Mat 10:1</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 10:9-15">9-15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi yaayeta abeegi be ikumi na babiri, yaatandika kubatuma babiri babiri, yaabaha obushoboorozi bw'okubinga baadaimoni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:1">Luk 10:1</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Yaabaragiira kutagira ki baagyendana, kureka enkoni yonka; kutakoma ntanda, kutatwara furebe, n'obu zaakuba empiiha omu nshaho zaabo; <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />kureka bagyende bajwaire enkaito; kandi n'okutatwara makanzu abiri. <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Kandi yaabaragiira ati: Enju yoona, ei muraataahemu, mube niyo mwagumamu okuhitsya obu murirugayo. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Kandi hoonahoona ahu batariikiriza kubaraaza, bakanga n'okubahurira, ku muriba nimurugayo, mutsigye mwabakunkumurira omucuucu gw'omu bigyere byanyu okuba eky'okushinja. <verse eid="MRK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Batyo baagyenda nibabuurira ku abantu bashemereire kweteisa. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:14">Yak 5:14</ref>, <ref loc="JAS 5:15">15</ref>. </char></note> Baabinga baadaimoni baingi, kandi baasiiga amajuta aha barwaire baingi, baakira.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Heroode okwita Yohaana Omubatizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:14-29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9:7-9</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14:1-12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omugabe Heroode yaabihurira, ahakuba eiziina rya Yesu rikaba ryarangainwe. Yaahamya ati: Ogwo ni Yohaana Omubatizi, azookire omu bafu; nikyo ainiire amaani aga agarikumukoresa. <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Kwonka abandi baagira bati: N'Eliya; abandi bati: Ni nabi nk'omwe ahari baanabi aba ira. <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Kwonka Heroode ku yaabihuriire, yaagira ati: Ni Yohaana ou naatemire omutwe, azookire. <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Ahakuba ebyo bitakabaireho, Heroode akatuma, baakwata Yohaana, baamuboha, baamuta omu kihome ahabwa Herodia, muka Filipo mwene ishe; ahabw'okuba Heroode akaba amuhindwire omukazi we. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Yohaana ku yaabimanyire, yaateisa Heroode, ati: Ebiragiro tibirikukwikiriza kushwera muka mwene sho. <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Herodia nikyo yaamwangiire, akenda kumwita; kwonka atabaase; <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />ahabw'okuba Heroode akaba naatiina Yohaana ahabw'okumumanya ku ari omuntu ohikiriire, kandi orikwera; yaamurinda. Kandi ku yaabaire agambira Yohaana, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nari: omuri bingi akaba amworobera, ashemereirwe. </char></note>bikaba bimushobera, kwonka akaba amuhurira ashemereirwe.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Bwanyima oburyo bwaboneka aha kiro ky'okwijuka okuzaarwa kwa Heroode, Heroode yaateekyera abaami be n'abakuru b'abaserukare n'abakungu ba Galilaaya obugyenyi. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Omwishiki wa Herodia yaija, yaazina, yaashemeza Heroode n'abagyenzi be. Omugabe nikwo kugira omwishiki ati: Nshaba eki orikwenda kyona, niinyija kukikuha. <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Yaarahira naamugira ati: Kyona kyona eki oranshabe, ninkikuha, n'obu kyakuba ekicweka ky'obugabe bwangye. <verse eid="MRK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Omwishiki yaashohora, yaabuuza nyina ati: Mbwenu iwe, okaayenzire ngu mmushabe ki? Yaamugarukamu ati: Omutwe gwa Yohaana Omubatizi. <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Ahonaaho omwishiki yaarahuka, yaagaruka aha mugabe, yaamushaba ati: Niinyenda hati mbwenu ompe omutwe gwa Yohaana Omubatizi omu rucuba. <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Omugabe yaashaasha munonga; kwonka ahabw'okushangwa yaarahiire omu maisho g'abagyenyi be, yaashoberwa kumubeiha. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Ahonaaho omugabe yaatuma omuserukare, yaamuragiira kumutemaho omutwe n'okugureeta. Omuserukare yaagyenda omu kihome, yaamutemaho omutwe, <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />yaagureeta omu rucuba, yaaguha omwishiki, omwishiki yaagutwarira nyina. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Abeegi ba Yohaana ku baakihuriire, baija, baatwara omutumbi gwe, baaguziika.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okuriisa abantu enkumi itaano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 9:10">Luk 9:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Entumwa zikagaruka ahari Yesu, zaamugambira ebi zaakozire byona, n'oku zaayegyeise. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Yaazigira ati: Mwije aheekiikire twehereere, muhuumureho; ahakuba hakaba hariho baingi abaabaire nibaija kandi nibagyenda; n'ahabw'ekyo Yesu n'abeegi be baabura omwanya nangwa n'ogw'okurya. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:32-44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:11-17">Luk 9:11-17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-13">Yoh 6:1-13</ref>. </char></note> Nikwo kugyenda omu bwato aheekiikire, ngu beehereere. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Kwonka abantu baingi baabareeba nibagyenda, baabamanya; baaruga omuri tauni zoona, nibairukanga, baaraba ogw'ebigyere, baabatangayo. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:17">Kub 27:17</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaayambukire enyanja, yaashanga aho omutwe gw'abantu baingi, yaabagirira esaasi, ahabw'okuba bakaba bari nk'entaama ezitaine muriisa; yaatandika kubeegyesa bingi. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 8:1-9">Mak 8:1-9</ref>. </char></note> Ku bwabaire omu mwabazyo, abeegi be baija ah'ari, baamugira bati: Aha n'eihamba, kandi bwaza kwira. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Raga abantu bagyende omu byaro n'omu birorero ebiri haihi, beegurire eby'okurya. <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />We yaabagarukamu ati: Mube niimwe mwabagaburira. Baamugira bati: Mbwenu shi, tugyende tugure emigaati y'edenaari magana abiri, tube niyo twabagaburira? <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Yaababuuza ati: Imwe mwineho engahi? Mugyende mwetegyereze. Ku baamanyire, baagira bati: Hariho etaano n'eby'enyanja bibiri. <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Yaabaragiira kubashutamya boona omu kacwamba omu miteeko. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Baashutama omu mitwe ya igana-igana, kandi n'eya makumi ataano-ataano. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Yaakwata egyo migaati etaano n'eby'enyanja bibiri, yaareeba ahaiguru, yaasiima, yaabega emigaati, yaaheereza abeegi be ngu bagite omu maisho g'abantu; n'eby'enyanja ebyo byombi yaabibaha boona. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Boona baarya, baahaaga. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Bwanyima baatorotoora oburagarika bw'emigaati n'eby'enyanja, baijuza ebitenga ikumi na bibiri. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Abo abaariire bakaba bari abashaija enkumi itaano.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okugyendesa amaguru aha maizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:45-56: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 14:22-36">Mat 14:22-36</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yoh 6:15-21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahonaaho yaagyema abeegi be ngu baze omu bwato, bamubandize seeri Besesaida, We atsigare abanze aragye abantu. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Ku yaaherize kubaraga, yaatemba ekibungo, yaaza kushaba. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Kandi ku bwabaire nibwira, obwato bwahika ahagati y'enyanja, We akiri omu kibungo wenka. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Yaareeba nibabuvuga baremesiibwe omuyaga gubaturukire omu maisho. Omu kusisiimuka kwa kana yaabaizira naagyendesa amaguru aha nyanja, yaashusha nk'orikwenda kubahinguraho. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Ku baamureebire naagyendesa amaguru aha nyanja, baateekateeka ngu n'omuzimu, baayamuza; <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />ahakuba boona bakamureeba baatiina. Ahonaaho yaagamba nabo, yaabahuumuriza, ati: Muhuumure, niinye, mutatiina. <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:51: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:39">Mak 4:39</ref>. </char></note> Yaaragara omu bwato, yaabashangamu. Ahonaaho omuyaga gwacureera. Boona baatangaarira kimwe; <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />kwonka tibarashoborokyeirwe by'emigaati, ahabw'okuba emitima yaabo ekaba egangaire.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okukiza abantu baingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Ku baayambukire, baahika omu nsi ya Genesareeti, baakoma obwato aha nkungu. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Ku baarugire omu bwato, ahonaaho abantu baamumanya, <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />bairuka baayegaba ebirari aho hoona, baatandika kuheeka abarwaire aha bitanda byabo, baabamushangisa ahu baabaire bahurira ari hoona. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:56: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:15">Byak 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:11">19:11</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 19:12">12</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima ahu yaabaire aza hoona, omu birorero, n'omuri tauni, n'omu byaro, bakaba babyamya abarwaire omu katare, baamweshengyereza ngu bakore n'aha mukugiro gw'ekanzu ye kwonka; kandi boona abaabaire bagukoraho, bakaba bakira.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'emigyenzo y'Abafarisaayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1-23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 15:1-20">Mat 15:1-20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abafarisaayo n'abamwe aha bahandiiki bakaruga Yerusaalemu, baayeteeranira ah'ari. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 11:38">Luk 11:38</ref>. </char></note> Baareeba bamwe aha beegi be nibariisa engaro zisiisikaire, nizo zitajabikire mu maizi ahabw'emigyenzo. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Ahakuba Abafarisaayo n'Abayudaaya boona tibarya ku baba batajabikire gye ngaro zaabo omu maizi, nibakuratira emigyenzo ya baishenkurubo. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Kandi ku baba nibaruga omu katare, tibarya batabandize kwoga. Kandi hariho n'endiijo migyenzo mingi, ei baaragiirwe kurinda, nk'okwozya ebikopo n'enyabya n'ebintu by'emiringa. <verse eid="MRK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Abafarisaayo n'abahandiiki baamubuuza bati: Ahabw'enki abeegi baawe batakurata migyenzo ya baishenkurubo, bafa okuriisa engaro zisiisikaire? <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">Isa 29:13</ref>. </char></note> Yaabagarukamu ati: Imwe ndyarya 'mwe, Isaaya akabaraguraho kurungi, nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ngu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">Ab'eihanga eri nibampaisa ekitiinisa eminwa yaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">Kwonka emitima yaabo endi hare.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Bandamiza busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">Ahakuba enyegyesa ey'ebi beegyesa okuba obuhamizo bw'ediini</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">N'ebiragiro by'abantu.<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Nimureka ekiragiro kya Ruhanga, ngu mugumye emigyenzo y'abantu. <verse eid="MRK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Yaabagambira ati: Imwe mwine obwengye burungi obw'okwangiramu ebiragiro bya Ruhanga, ngu mubone kuhamira aha migyenzo yaanyu! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Ahakuba Musa akagira ati: Otiine sho na nyoko; kandi ati: Orijuma ishe nari nyina, buzimazima aitwe. <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Kwonka imwe nimugira muti: Omuntu ku araagambire ishe nari nyina ati: Eki naakukuhaire ni Koribaani, amakuru gaakyo ngu, N'ekihongyeirwe Ruhanga; <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />muba mutakimwikiriza kugira eki yaakorera ishe nari nyina. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Omu buryo obwo ekigambo kya Ruhanga mukihindura busha ahabw'emigyenzo yaanyu eyaahindukire akarande. Kandi mukora n'ebindi bingi nk'ebyo.<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Kandi yaagaruka yaayeta abantu, yaabagira ati: Mumpurire mwena, mwetegyereze. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:14">Byak 10:14</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 10:15">15</ref>. </char></note> Tihariho kintu ekiri aheeru y'omuntu, ekimutaahamu kikamushiisha; kwonka ebiruga omunda ye nibyo bimushiisha. <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Omuntu oine amatu agarikuhurira, ahurire.<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Ku yaarugire omu bantu, yaataaha omu nju; abeegi be baamubuuza amakuru g'enfumu egyo. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Yaababuuza ati: Biri shi naimwe timwine bwengye? Timurikumanya ngu kyona ekiruga aheeru, kikataaha omu muntu, tikibaasa kumushiisha? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Ahabw'okuba tikimutaaha mu mutima, kureka omunda, kandi namwo kigaruka kyogamu, kishohora. (Akagamba atyo, naahamya ku hatariho kiriibwa kyona ekirikuzira.) <verse eid="MRK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Yaagaruka yaagira ati: Ekiruga omu muntu nikyo kimushiisha; <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />ahakuba omunda omu mitima y'abantu nimwo haruga ebiteekateeko bibi, okushambana, okwiba, okwita, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />okwetenga okubi, okukora kubi, okuryarya, okurigira okubi, eitima, okubeiherera abandi, amaryo, n'okwefiisa omutima. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Ebibi ebyo byona biruga omu muntu, kandi nibyo bimushiisha.<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okukiza omwana w'omugriikakazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:24-30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mat 15:21-28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaimuka, yaarugayo, yaaza omu ishaza rya Tuuro n'erya Sidoni. Yaataaha omu nju, atarikwenda muntu weena kukimanya; kwonka tarabaasize kutamanywa. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Ahonaaho omukazi, owaabaire aine akaishiki akaabaire kariho daimoni, ku yaamuhuriire, yaija, yaamukwata amaguru. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Kandi omukazi ogwo akaba ari Omugriika, oruganda rwe ari Omusirofoiniiki. Yaamweshengyereza kubinga daimoni aha mwana we. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Yesu yaamugambira ati: Reka abaana baabanze bahaagye; ahakuba ti kirungi kwaka abaana eby'okurya, okabitambikira embwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Omukazi ogwo yaamwikiriza ati: Eego, Mukama wangye; kwonka embwa nazo, eziri ahansi y'emeeza, zirya oburagarika bw'abaana. <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Yesu yaamugira ati: Ahabw'ekigambo ekyo yegyendere; omwana waawe daimoni yaamurugaho. <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Omukazi yaagaruka omu ka ye, yaashanga omwana arambiire aha kitanda, daimoni yaamurugireho.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okukiza ekiteta ky'ekifamatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Bwanyima yaagaruka naaruga omu ishaza rya Tuuro, yaaraba Sidoni; ku yaarabire omu ishaza rya Dekapooli, yaahika aha nyanja ya Galilaaya. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Baamureetera ekiteta ky'ekifa-matu; bamweshengyereza ngu amuteho engaro. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Yaamwiha omu mutwe gw'abantu, yaamwekiikana, yaamuta enkumu omu matu, kandi yaacwera amacwante, yaamukora aha rurimi; <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />yaareeba ahaiguru omu iguru, omwitsyo gwamuruga hare, yaamugambira ati: Efasa! Amakuru gaakyo ngu, Iguka. <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Amatu ge gaiguka, n'engata y'orurimi rwe yaakomooroka, yaagamba gye. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Kandi yaabeehanangiriza kutagira u baakigambira; kwonka ahi yaagarukiire kubeehanangiriza, bakakizaho kukirangaana. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Baatangaara munonga barengyesereza, baagira bati: Byona yaabikora gye; yaahuriza ekifa-matu, kandi yaagambisa ekiteta.<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu okuriisa abantu 4,000</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:1-10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mat 15:32-39</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo omutwe gw'abantu baingi gukeeteerana, bwanyima baabura eby'okurya. Yesu yaayeta abeegi be, yaabagira ati: <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 6:34-44">Mak 6:34-44</ref>. </char></note> Ninsaasira abantu aba, ahabw'okuba bamazire aha naanye ebiro bishatu, kandi hati tibaine by'okurya. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Ku ndaaboohereze kugaruka owaabo basiibirekwo, nibaija kugwera enshazi omu muhanda; kandi mumanye ngu abamwe omuribo barugire hare. <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Abeegi be baamugarukamu bati: Mbwenu omuntu naabaasa ata kugaburira aba bantu aha omu ihamba? <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yaababuuza ati: Hari mwine emigaati engahi? Baamugarukamu bati: Ni mushanju. <verse eid="MRK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Yaaragiira abantu kushutama ahansi; ku yaaherize kusiima yaagibega, yaagiha abeegi be kugiha abantu; nabo baagibata omu maisho. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Kandi bakaba baine eby'enyanja bikye; ku yaaherize kubishabira omugisha, yaaragiira ngu nabyo babibate omu maisho. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Baarya baahaaga; baatorotoora oburagarika obwatsigaireho, baijuza ebiibo mushanju. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Abantu bakaba bari nk'enkumi ina. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Yaabaraga; ahonaaho yaagaruka omu bwato n'abeegi be, yaayambuka, naaza omu kyanga kya Dalmanusa.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekitumbisa ky'Abafarisaayo nikwo kwegyesa kwabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:11-21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:1-12">Mat 16:1-12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abafarisaayo baija kumubuuza nibamuhakanisa, baamushaba akamanyiso akarikuruga omu iguru nibamutega. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Omwitsyo gwamuruga hare, yaagira ati: Ab'obusingye obu nibendera ki akamanyiso? Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Ab'obusingye obu tibarireeba kamanyiso. <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Yaabatsigaho, yaaza omu bwato, yaayambuka seeri.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Kwonka bakaba beebirwe kukoma entanda, kandi omu bwato bakaba baine omugaati gumwe gwonka. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:1">Luk 12:1</ref>. </char></note> Yaabeehanangiriza ati: Reeba, mwerinde ekitumbisa ky'Abafarisaayo n'ekya Heroode. <verse eid="MRK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Baagambirana bati: Eki arikufa n'ahabw'okuba titwine migaati. <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Yesu ku yaabimanyire, yaababuuza ati: Nimufa ki aha by'emigaati? Timukamanyire n'obu kwakuba okushoborokyerwa? Mukiine emitima egangaire? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 12:2">Ezk 12:2</ref>. </char></note> Ka mwine amaisho, timureeba? Ka mwine amatu, timuhurira? Nari shi, timwijuka? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Ku naagaburiire abantu enkumi itaano emigaati etaano, mukatorotoora ebitenga bingahi ebiijwire oburagarika? Baamugarukamu bati: Ikumi na bibiri. <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />Kandi shi, ku naagaburiire enkumi ina emigaati mushanju, bwo mukatorotoora ebiibo biijwire bingahi? Baamugarukamu bati: Ni mushanju. <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Yaabagira ati: Timukashoborokyeirwe?<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okuhumuura empumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Baagarukayo, baahika Besesaida. Baamureetera empumi, baamweshengyereza ngu agikoreho. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 7:32">Mak 7:32</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 7:33">33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 9:6">Yoh 9:6</ref>. </char></note> Yaakwata empumi omukono, yaagishohoza okuruga omu kirorero; ku yaaherize kumucwera amacwante omu maisho, yaamukoraho n'engaro, yaamubuuza ati: Mbwenu hati, oine eki orikureeba? <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Yaabuuruura amaisho, yaagira ati: Nindeeba abantu; kwonka nibansusira nk'emiti baaba nibagyenda. <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Yesu yaagaruka, yaamuta engaro aha maisho, empumi egyo yaayetegyereza, yaakira, yaareeba byona kurungi. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:18-27">Luk 9:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-9:1">Mak 8:27—9:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:13-28">Mat 16:13-28</ref>. </char></note> Yaamwohereza kutaaha owe, naamugira ati: Nangwa otagaruka n'omu kirorero.<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero okuhamya ku Yesu ari Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Yesu yaagumizamu n'abeegi be, baataaha omu birorero bya Kaisarea-Filipi. Ku baabaire nibakigyenda, yaabuuza abeegi be ati: Beitu abantu bagira ngu mba oha? <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Baamugarukamu bati: Abamwe nibagira ngu, ori Yohaana Omubatizi; abandi ngu: Ori Eliya; kandi abandi ngu: Ori omwe ahari baanabi. <verse eid="MRK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:67-69">Yoh 6:67-69</ref>. </char></note> Yaagaruka yaababuuza ati: Mbwenu shi imwe, mugira ngu mba oha? Petero yaamugarukamu ati: Ori Kristo. <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Yesu yaabeehanangiriza kutakigambiraho ondiijo.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Yaiha aho, yaatandika kubeegyesa ku Omwana w'omuntu ashemereire kubonabonesibwa omuri bingi, n'okwangwa abakuru n'abanyamurwa abakuru n'abahandiiki, n'okwitwa, kandi n'okuzooka bwanyima y'ebiro bishatu. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Ekigambo ekyo akakigamba butunu. Bwanyima Petero yaamuta aha rubaju, yaamuteisa. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Yesu yaahinduka, yaareeba abeegi be, yaahana Petero, naagira ati: Garuka enyima yangye, Sitaane; ahakuba torikuteekateeka bya Ruhanga, kureka eby'abantu.<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'omuhanda gw'omusharaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Yaayeta emitwe y'abantu n'abeegi be, yaabagira ati: Omuntu weena ku araayende kunkuratira, ayeyangise, ayekorere omusharaba gwe, ankuratire. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat 10:39</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba omuntu weena orikwenda kukiza amagara ge, aryagabuza; kandi weena orikubuza amagara ge ahabwangye n'ahabw'engiri, aryagakiza. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Mbwenu omuntu kiryamugasira ki okutunga ensi yoona, haza akafeerwa amagara ge? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Nari shi, omuntu akaahaireyo ki okucungura amagara ge? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:33">Mat 10:33</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ngu omuntu weena orikwitwa enshoni ahabwangye n'ahabw'ebigambo byangye omu busingye obu obw'obushambani, haza kandi obubi, Omwana w'omuntu nawe aryaitwa enshoni ahabwe, ku ariizira omu kitiinisa kya Ishe na baamaraika abarikwera.<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Yaabagira ati: Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Omuri aba abeemereire aha, hariho bamwe abarireeba obukama bwa Ruhanga nibwija n'amaani, batakafiire.<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuhindurwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:2-13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9:28-36</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mat 17:1-13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'ebiro mukaaga Yesu yaagyenda na Petero na Yakobo na Yohaana bonka, yaabahitsya aha mutwe gw'orushozi ruraingwa, yaahindurirwa omu maisho gaabo; <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />ebijwaro bye byamurinkana, byayera tiitiiti, kandi tihariho mwozi omu nsi owaakubaasize kubyeza atyo. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Kandi Eliya na Musa baababonekyera, nibagaaniira na Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Petero yaagira Yesu ati: Mwegyesa, ni kirungi obu turi aha; twombekye obuju bushatu, akamwe kabe akaawe, akandi kabe aka Musa, n'akandi aka Eliya. <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Akaba atarikumanya eki ashemereire kugamba, ahabw'okuba bakaba batiinire munonga. <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mak 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 1:17">2 Pet 1:17</ref>. </char></note> Ahonaaho ekicu kyaija, kyabasangira; eiraka ryayema omu kicu nirigira riti: Ogu n'Omwana wangye ou nkunda; mumuhurire. <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Ahonaaho ku baamagamagire, tibaareebaho muntu ondiijo, kureka Yesu wenka.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Ku baabaire nibashuuma, nibaruga aha rushozi, Yesu yaabeehanangiriza kutagira u baagambira ahari byona ebi baareebire, okuhitsya obu Omwana w'omuntu arizooka omu bafu. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Baakyerinda, nibeebuuza bonka bati: Okuzooka omu bafu n'enki? <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Kandi baamubuuza bati: Ahabw'enki abahandiiki bagira ngu, Eliya ashemereire kubanza kwija? <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 53:3">Isa 53:3</ref>. </char></note> Yaabagarukamu ati: N'eky'amazima; Eliya niwe w'okubanza kwija, abone kushemeza byona; beitu eby'Omwana w'omuntu byo bikahandiikwa bita, ngu ashemereire kubonabonesibwa omuri bingi, n'okugaywa? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Kwonka nyowe nimbagambira nti: Eliya araizire, kandi bakamutwaza nk'oku baayenzire, nk'oku kyamuhandiikirweho.<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okukiza omwana omugwi w'entsimbo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:14-29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 9:37-42">Luk 9:37-42</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mat 17:14-21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku baahikire aha beegi be abandi, baashanga omutwe gw'abantu gubeehinguririize. Abahandiiki nibabahakanisa. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Ahonaaho abantu boona ku baamureebire, baatangaara munonga, bairuka baaza kumuramutsya. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yaababuuza ati: Mwaba nimuhakana ki? <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Omwe ahari abo bantu yaamugarukamu ati: Mwegyesa, nkureeteire omwana wangye, ahakuba ariho daimoni otarikugamba. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Ahu amukwatira hoona, amuteera ahansi; omwana areeta eifuro, anena amaino, agangaara; naashaba abeegi baawe kumubinga, baaremwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yesu yaagambira abeegi be ati: Imwe abatarikwikiriza, ndyahitsya hi okuguma naimwe; ndyahitsya hi okubagumisiririza? Mumundeetere! <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Baamumureetera. Daimoni ku yaamureebire, ahonaaho yaatetemya omwana, omwana yaagwa ahansi, yaayekuringa, yaareeta eifuro. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yesu yaabuuza ishe ati: Akakwatwa ryari endwara egi? Ishe ati: Akakwatwa akiri muto. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Kaingi amutuura omu muriro n'omu maizi kumwita; ku oraabe noobaasa endwara egi, otugirire embabazi, otuhwere. <verse eid="MRK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yesu yaamugira ati: Wangira ngu, Ku ndaabe nimbaasa! Eego, byona nibibaasika ahari ogwo orikwikiriza. <verse eid="MRK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:5">Luk 17:5</ref>. </char></note> Ahonaaho ishe w'omwana yaagamba munonga ati: Niinyikiriza! Onkize obutaikiriza bwangye! <verse eid="MRK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Yesu ku yaareebire abantu baingi nibairuka nibamwizira, yaagambira kubi daimoni, yaamugira ati: Iwe daimoni otarikugamba, otarikuhurira, naakuragiira, murugyeho, otarimugarukaho obundi. <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Daimoni yaayamuza, yaamutetemya munonga, yaamurugaho; omwana yaaba nk'ofiire; abangi baagira ngu, yaafa. <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Kwonka Yesu yaamukwata aha mukono, yaamwimutsya; omwana yaayemerera.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Ku baataahire omu nju, abeegi be baamubuuza omu mubonano, bati: Itwe ahanki tutaabaasa kumubinga? <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yaabagarukamu ati: Daimoni ow'omuringo nk'ogu tarikubingwa kindi kureka okushaba n'okwesiibyakwo.<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:30-32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk 9:43-45</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:22">Mat 17:22</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 17:23">23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baarugayo, baaraba Galilaaya, kandi tarenzire muntu weena kukimanya,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:1">Yoh 7:1</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />ahakuba akaba naayegyesa abeegi be ati: Omwana w'omuntu aryaheebwayo omu mikono y'abantu, bamwite; kandi ku ariheza kwitwa, aryazooka bwanyima y'ebiro bishatu. <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Kwonka tibaramanyire ki arikugamba; n'okutiina baatiina kumubuuza.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okuhana abeegi be ahabw'ekibi ky'okwekuza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:33-50: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 18:1-9">Mat 18:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-50">Luk 9:46-50</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baahika Kaperenaumu; ku yaabaire ari omu nju, yaababuuza ati: Mwaba nimuhakana ki omu muhanda? <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Baahunama kwonka, ahabw'okuba ku baabaire bari omu muhanda, baahakana bonka ngu, N'oha oriba omukuru omuribo? <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:44">Mak 10:44</ref>. </char></note> Yaashutama, yaayeta bari ikumi na babiri, yaabagira ati: Omuntu oryenda kuba ow'okubanza, ogwo ashemereire kuba ow'enyima y'abandi boona, kandi omuheereza wa boona. <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Yaakwata omwana muto, yaamuta ahagati yaabo, yaamukiikira omu mikono, yaabagira ati: <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat 10:40</ref>. </char></note> Weena orikwakiira omwe aha baana bato nk'ogu omu iziina ryangye, biri niinye ayakiire; kandi n'omuntu weena orikuunyakiira, tiinye arikwakiira, kureka Ogwo owantumire.<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:38: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 11:27">Kub 11:27</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 11:28">28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yohaana yaamugira ati: Mwegyesa, tukareeba omuntu naabinga daimoni omu iziina ryawe, twamuzibira, ahakuba akaba atarikukwatanisa naitwe. <verse eid="MRK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Yesu yaamugarukamu ati: Mutamuzibira; ahakuba tihaine muntu weena okora eky'okutangaaza omu iziina ryangye, oribaasa kuhinduka juba, akangamba kubi; <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:30">Mat 12:30</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba omuntu weena otari muzigu waitu, aba ari owaitu. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:42">Mat 10:42</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omuntu weena oribaha enkyeka y'amaizi ahabw'okuba aba Kristo, buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Tariimwa bihembo bye.<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okuteisa abarikuhabya abandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Omuntu weena orireetera omwe ahari abo bato abarikuunyikiriza kukora ekibi, haakiri ogwo okubohwa orubengo omu bitsya, akanagwa omu nyanja. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Omukono gwawe ku guraabe nigukureetera kukora ekibi, ogutemeho; haakiri iwe okutaaha omu magara ori ekimuga, okukira okuza Gehena omu muriro ogutaraara, oine emikono yombi, <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />ahu enyogori zaabo zitafa, n'ahu omuriro gutaraara. <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />N'ekigyere kyawe ku kiraabe nikikureetera kukora ekibi, okitemeho; haakiri iwe okutaaha omu magara ori ekimuga, okukira okuza Gehena oine ebigyere byombi, <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />ahu enyogori zaabo zitafa, n'ahu omuriro gutaraara. <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:29">Mat 5:29</ref>. </char></note> N'eriisho ryawe ku riraabe nirikureetera kukora ekibi, oriihemu; haakiri iwe okutaaha omu bukama bwa Ruhanga oine eriisho rimwe, okukira okuza Gehena oine amaisho gombi. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:24">Isa 66:24</ref>. </char></note> Ahu enyogori zaabo zitafa, n'ahu omuriro gutaraara. <verse eid="MRK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Buri muntu aryabugwamu omuriro nk'oku omwonyo guhika omu by'okurya. <verse eid="MRK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:50: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 14:34">Luk 14:34</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:6">Kol 4:6</ref>. </char></note> Omwonyo ni murungi; mbwenu ku guraabe guhweirwemu ensha, muryagigaruramu muta? Imwe mugire omwonyo omu mitima yaanyu, kandi mugire obusingye omuntu na mugyenzi we.<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'okushenda abakazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1-12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 19:1-9">Mat 19:1-9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Yesu yaimuka yaarugayo, yaaza omu ishaza rya Buyudaaya na seeri ya yorudani; emitwe minti y'abantu yaagaruka yaateeranira ahu yaabaire ari; yaayeyongyera kubeegyesa nk'omucwe gwe oku gwabaire guri. <verse eid="MRK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Kandi Abafarisaayo baija ah'ari, baamubuuza nibamutega bati: Beitu Ebiragiro biikiriza omuntu kushenda omukazi we? <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yaabagarukamu ati: Musa akabaragiira ata? <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:1">Bir 24:1</ref>. </char></note> Baagarukamu bati: Musa akaikiriza omuntu kuhandiika ebaruha y'okutaana n'omukazi we, ngu abone kumushenda. <verse eid="MRK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Yesu yaabagira ati: Eki yaabahereire ekiragiro ekyo n'ahabw'obugangaazi bw'omu mitima yaanyu; <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />kwonka okuruga aha kuhangwa kw'ensi, Ruhanga akahanga omushaija n'omukazi. <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Kut 2:24</ref>. </char></note> Omushaija nikyo atsigiraho ishe na nyina, akaguma n'omukazi we, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />n'abo bombi bakahinduka omuntu omwe; baba batakiri babiri kureka omwe. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />N'ahabw'ekyo eki Ruhanga yaateeraine hamwe, omuntu atarikitaanisa.<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Ku baabaire bari omu nju, abeegi be baagaruka baamubuuza aha kigambo ekyo. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16:18</ref>. </char></note> Yaabashobororera ati: Omuntu weena orishenda omukazi we, akashwera ondiijo, biri ashambaine, kandi aitsire obushwere aha mukazi we; <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />n'omukazi ku aritaana na iba, yaashwerwa ondi, biri ashambaine.<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okuha abaana omugisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:13-16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19:13-15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi bakamureetera abaana bato ngu abakoreho; abeegi be baagambira kubi abaabareeta. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Kwonka Yesu ku yaakireebire, yaabagwerwa kubi, yaabagira ati: Murekye abaana bato baije ahariinye, mutabazibira; ahabw'okuba obukama bwa Ruhanga n'obw'abari nk'abo. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:3">Mat 18:3</ref>. </char></note> Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Omuntu weena otaikiriza bukama bwa Ruhanga nk'omwana muto, taributaahamu na kakye. <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Yaabakiikira, yaabaha omugisha, abataireho engaro.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'omutsigazi omutungi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:17-31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18:18-30</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19:16-30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku yaabaire naagyenda omu muhanda, omushaija yaija nairukanga, yaamutsimbira amaju, yaamubuuza ati: Iwe Mwegyesa murungi 'we, nkaakora ki okuhungura amagara agatahwaho? <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesu yaamugarukamu ati: Noonyetera ki omurungi? Tihariho murungi, kureka Ruhanga wenka. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Noomanya ebiragiro, Otariita, Otarishambana, Otariiba, Otaribeiherera ondiijo, Otarigobya, Otiine sho na nyoko. <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Omushaija yaamugarukamu ati: Mwegyesa, ebyo byona nkabyerinda okuruga omu buto bwangye. <verse eid="MRK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mat 10:38</ref>. </char></note> Yesu ku yaamureebire, yaamukunda, yaamugira ati: Mbwenu nooburwaho kimwe; irooko ogyende, otunde byona ebi otungire; ebi oraihemu, obihe abooro; nibwo oritunga eitungo omu iguru; haza oije onkuratire. <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Ku yaahuriire ebyo, yaahinduriza ahamaisho, yaagyenda aine enaku nyingi, ahabw'okuba akaba aine eitungo ringi.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yesu nikwo kubabuzyamu amaisho, akagira abeegi be ati: Ka nikiremeera abatungi okutaaha omu bukama bwa Ruhanga! <verse eid="MRK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 62:10">Zab 62:10</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 6:17">1 Tim 6:17</ref>. </char></note> Abeegi be baatangaarira ebigambo bye. Kwonka Yesu yaabashobororera ati: Baana mwe, nikiremeera abeesiga obutungi okutaaha omu bukama bwa Ruhanga. <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Nikirahuka engamira okuraba omu nyindo y'empitirizo, okukira omutungi okutaaha omu bukama bwa Ruhanga. <verse eid="MRK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Baatangaara munonga, baamubuuza bati: Mbwenu shi hoona, n'oha orikubaasa kujunwa? <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Kut 18:14</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaabareeba, yaabagarukamu ati: Ekyo tikirikubaasika ha bantu, kwonka ahari Ruhanga byona nibibaasika. <verse eid="MRK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Petero nikwo kumugambira ati: Reeba itwe tukatsigaho byona, twakukuratira! <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesu yaamugarukamu ati: Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Tihaine muntu owaatsigireho enju, beene ishe, banyaanya, nyina, ishe, abaana, nari ekibanja kye ahabwangye n'ahabw'engiri, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />otariheebwa omu biro bya hati ebirikukira ebyo emirundi igana, enju, beene ishe, banyaanya, baanyina, abaana, ebibanja, hamwe n'okuhiigwa, kandi omu biro bya bwanyima akaheebwa amagara agatahwaho. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Kwonka baingi ab'okubanza baryaba aba bwanyima, n'aba bwanyima baryaba ab'okubanza.<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okumanyisa eby'okufa kwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:32-34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20:17-19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwo bakaba bari omu muhanda nibainamuka Yerusaalemu, kandi Yesu akaba abeebembeire; bo baatangaara, n'abaabaire bamukuratiire baatiina. Yaagaruka yaayekiikana bari ikumi na babiri, yaatandika kubagambira ebirikwija kumubaho;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:16">Yoh 11:16</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />ati: Reeba, nitwinamuka Yerusaalemu; Omwana w'omuntu aryaheebwayo aha banyamurwa abakuru n'abahandiiki; baryamucwera orubanja rw'okumwita, bamuheyo aha Banyamahanga; <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />baryamushungisa, bamucwere amacwante; baryamwasha, baryamwita; kandi aryazooka bwanyima y'ebiro bishatu.<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obukuru omu bukama bwa Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:35-45: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mat 20:20-28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Yakobo na Yohaana, beene Zebedaayo, baamwirira haihi, baamushaba bati: Mwegyesa, nitwenda otukorere eki turaakushabe kyona. <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Yaabagarukamu ati: Nimwenda ngu mbakorere ki? <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Baamugarukamu bati: Twikirize omwe ashutame aha rubaju rwawe rwa buryo, n'ondi aha rwa bumosho omu kitiinisa kyawe. <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:50">Luk 12:50</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 6:3">Rom 6:3</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaabagarukamu ati: Timurikumanya ki murikushaba. Nimubaasa kunywa aha kikopo eki ndikunywaho, nari okubatizibwa okubatizibwa oku ndikubatizibwamu? <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:2">Byak 12:2</ref>. </char></note> Baamugarukamu bati: Eego, nitubaasa. Yesu yaabagarukamu ati: Ekikopo eki ndikunywaho naimwe muryakinywaho; n'okubatizibwa oku ndikubatizibwamu, muryakubatizibwamu. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Kwonka okushutama aha rubaju rwangye rwa buryo nari shi aha rwa bumosho, tiinye nkuha; kureka n'okwabo abaakucumiirwe. <verse eid="MRK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Kandi eikumi ku baakihuriire, baatandika kugwerwa kubi Yakobo na Yohaana. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:25-27">Luk 22:25-27</ref>. </char></note> Yesu nikwo kubeeta, akabagira ati: Nimumanya ngu abo abeetwa abategyeki b'abanyamahanga babategyekyesa eikama, n'abakuru baabo babaragiiza obushoboorozi. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Kwonka omuriimwe tikwo kiriba; weena oryenda kuba omukuru omuriimwe, ashemereire kuba omuheereza waanyu; <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />n'oryenda kuba ow'okubanza omuriimwe, ashemereire kuba omuhuuku wa boona. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Ahabw'okuba omu mazima Omwana w'omuntu taraizire kuheerezibwa, kureka okuheereza abandi, n'okuhayo amagara ge okucungura baingi.<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okuhumuura Batimaayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:46-52: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18:35-43</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20:29-34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi bakataaha Yeriko; ku yaabaire naaruga Yeriko n'abeegi be n'omutwe gw'abantu baingi, omusheegi Batimaayo, mwene Timaayo, empumi akaba ashutami aha rubaju rw'omuhanda. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Ku yaahuriire ngu orikwija ni Yesu owa Nazareesi, yaatandika kwamuza n'eiraka rihango, naagira ati: Yesu, omwana wa Daudi, ongirire embabazi! <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Kandi baingi baamuteisa, ngu acureere; kwonka we yaagumizamu naagamba munonga ati: Mwana wa Daudi, ongirire embabazi! <verse eid="MRK 10:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yesu yaayemerera, yaagira ati: Nimumwete. Baamweta, baamugambira bati: Huumura; imuka, naakweta. <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Nawe yaanaga omwenda gwe, yaabandatuka, yaija ahari Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yesu yaamubuuza ati: Nooyenda ngu nkukorere ki? Ogwo mushaija yaamugarukamu ati: <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rabooni, amakuru ngu, Mwegyesa. </char></note>Rabooni, niinyenda ngu mpumuukye. <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yesu yaamwikiriza ati: Irooko, okwikiriza kwawe nikwo kwakukiza. Ahonaaho yaahumuuka, yaamukuratira omu muhanda.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu okutaaha omuri Yerusaalemu n'ekitiinisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1-10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 19:29-38">Luk 19:29-38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:1-9">Mat 21:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-16">Yoh 12:12-16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ku bairiire haihi na Yerusaalemu, baahika Besifaage na Besania aha kibungo kya Zeituuni; yaatuma abeegi be babiri, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />yaabagira ati: Mugyende omu kirorero ekibari omu maisho; ahonaaho ku muraataahemu, nimwija kushangamu omwana gw'endogoya gutsibikire, ogutakatembwahoga muntu; mugutsibure, mugundeetere. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Omuntu weena, ku araababuuze ati: Nimugutsiburira ki? Imwe mugarukyemu muti, Mukama waitu naagwenda, kandi naija kugugarura juba. <verse eid="MRK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Batyo baagyenda, baashanga omwana gw'endogoya gutsibikire aha irembo aha rubaju rw'omuhanda; baagutsibura. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Kandi bamwe aha baabaire beemereire aho, baababuza bati: Nimukora ki okutsibura omwana gw'endogoya? <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Baabagarukamu nk'oku Yesu yaabagambira; baabareka. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Baareetera Yesu omwana gw'endogoya, baagutaho ebijwaro byabo; Yesu yaagutembaho. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Baingi baayarira ebijwaro byabo omu nguuto, abandi amababi agu baihire omu misiri. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25">Zab 118:25</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 118:26">26</ref>. </char></note> Abamushendekyereize bamwebembeire, n'abandi bamuri enyima, baayeshongora n'eiraka rihango bati: Hosana, Orikwija omu iziina rya Mukama asiimwe! <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Obugabe oburikwija obwa tatenkuriitwe Daudi busiimwe! Hosana ahaiguru munonga!<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okushemeza hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:11-24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:12-22">Mat 21:12-22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaahika omuri Yerusaalemu, yaataaha omuri hekalu; ku yaarabizemu amaisho kwetegyereza byona, yaashohora; kandi ahakuba bukaba bwaizire, yaaza Besania na bari ikumi na babiri. <verse eid="MRK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Omu kasheeshe, ku baabaire bahika omu muhanda nibaruga Besania, yaagira enjara. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Ku yaareebire hangahari omutiini oguriho amababi, yaagyenda yaaguhikaho, ngu akaagira eki yaagushangaho. Kwonka ku yaaguhikireho, tiyaashangaho kantu kureka omubengyeyo gw'amababi, ahabw'okuba bukaba butari bunaku bw'okwana. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Yaagugira ati: Okuruga hati okuhitsya ebiro byona hatarigira omuntu owaarya aha byana byawe. N'abeegi be baakihurira.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 2:14-16">Yoh 2:14-16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baagumizamu, baahika Yerusaalemu. Yaataaha omuri hekalu, yaatandika kubingamu abaabaire nibatunda, n'abaabaire nibagurira omuri hekalu; yaajuumika emeeza z'abarikuhingisa empiiha, n'ebitebe by'abo abaabaire nibatunda enkombe; <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />kandi tiyaikiriza muntu weena kurabya omuri hekalu ekintu akyekoreire. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Yer 7:11</ref>. </char></note> Yaayegyesa naabagambira ati: Timurikumanya ku kyahandiikirwe ngu, Enju yangye eryayetwa enju y'okuguma neeshabirwamu amahanga goona? Mbwenu imwe mugihindwire enyanga y'abambuzi, <verse eid="MRK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Abanyamurwa abakuru n'abahandiiki, ku baakihuriire, baacwa obwengye oku baraamwite; kwonka baamutiina, ahabw'okuba abantu boona bakaba nibatangaarira okwegyesa kwe. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Kandi ku bwabaire bwira, aruga omu rurembo.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okwoma kw'omuti ogu Yesu yaakyeenire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Kandi ku baabaire nibahingura omu kasheeshe akandi, baareeba ogwo mutiini gwomire okwiha omu mizi. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Petero yaijuka ekibaireho, yaagira Yesu ati: Rabi, reeba omutiini ogu okyeenire gwomire! <verse eid="MRK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yesu yaabagarukamu naagira ati: Mwesigye Ruhanga! <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:6">Luk 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mat 17:20</ref>. </char></note> Kandi buzima nimbagambira nti: Weena origira orushozi oru ati, Tsinduka, onagwe omu nyanja, atarikubanganisa mu mutima gwe, naikiriza ngu eki arikugamba nikiija kubakwo, aryakikorerwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:7">Mat 7:7</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 16:23">Yoh 16:23</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo ndikubagirira nti: Byona ebi murishaba omu kushaba kwanyu, mwikirize ngu mubihairwe, kandi kwo muryabiheebwa. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Obutoosha ku muraagume mwayemerera nimushaba, mwaba mwine ekigambo aha muntu weena, mumusaasire; na Shoimwe ori omu iguru abone kubasaasira eby'okushiisha byanyu. <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:14">Mat 6:14</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 6:15">15</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba ku muraabe mutarikusaasira, na Shoimwe ori omu iguru taribasaasira by'okushiisha byanyu.<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abanyamurwa okubuuza Yesu ahu yaihire obushoboorozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:27-33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21:23-27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi baagaruka Yerusaalemu. Ku yaabaire naagyendagyenda omuri hekalu, abanyamurwa abakuru n'abahandiiki n'abakuru b'abantu baija ah'ari, <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />baamubuuza bati: Ni bushoboorozi ki oburikukukoresa ebi, nari shi n'oha owaakuhaire obushoboorozi obu kubikora? <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yesu yaabagarukamu ati: Reka naanye mbabuuze ekigambo kimwe; haza mungarukyemu, naanye mbone kubashobororera obushoboorozi oburikunkoresa ebi. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Okubatiza kwa Yohaana kukaruga omu iguru nari omu bantu? Mungarukyemu. <verse eid="MRK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Baayegarukanamu nibagira bati: Ku turaagire tuti, Kukaruga omu iguru, naatugarukamu ati: Kandi shi, n'enki ekyabazibiire kumwikiriza? <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Tugire tuti, Kukaruga omu bantu? Baatiina abantu, ahakuba abantu boona bakaba nibahamya ngu Yohaana ni nabi buzima. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Baamugarukamu bati: Titurikuhamanya. Yesu nikwo kubagira ati: Naanye tindikubagambira bushoboorozi oburikunkoresa ebi.<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Enfumu y'abahingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1-12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20:9-19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21:33-46</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi akatandika kubacwera enfumu, ati: Omuntu akabyara omusiri gw'emizaabibu, yaaguzitirira orugo, yaarimamu einyuukiro rya viinyo, yaayombekamu eirindiro; yaagutsigamu abahingi, yaagyenda omu nsi endiijo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:1">Isa 5:1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 5:2">2</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Mbwenu obunaku bw'okwera ku bwahikire, yaatuma omuhuuku we ahari abo bahingi, ngu bamutwekyere aha byana by'emizaabibu. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Abahingi baamukwata, baamuteera, baamubinga, yaagarukayo atabiine. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Yaagaruka yaabatumaho ondiijo muhuuku; ogwo baamuhutaaza omutwe, baamuhemangura. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Nabwo yaagaruka yaabatumaho ondiijo, ogwo baamwita; n'abandi baingi, abamwe baabateera, abandi baabaita. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Kwonka akaba atsigaize omutabani ou arikukunda; yaamubatumaho bwanyima, naagira ati: Omwana wangye baryamuha ekitiinisa. <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Kwonka abo bahingi baagambirana bonka nibagira bati: ogu niwe muhunguzi; murekye tumwite, n'obuhunguzi buryaba obwaitu. <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:12">Heb 13:12</ref>. </char></note> Baamukwata, baamwita, baamunaga aheeru y'omusiri gw'emizaabibu. <verse eid="MRK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Mbwenu mukama w'emizaabibu aryakora ki? Aryaija, acwekyereze abo bahingi, n'omusiri gw'emizaabibu aguheereze abandi. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Zab 118:22</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 118:23">23</ref>. </char></note> Timukashomaga ekyahandiikirwe eki ngu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">Eibaare eri abombeki baayangire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">12:10 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Omu Rugriika: Niryo ryahindukire omutwe gw'enshonda. </char>
    </note>Niryo ryahindukire erikuru ery'obuhamizo bw'enju.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Ekyo kikaruga ahari Mukama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:11">Kandi n'eky'okutangaaza omu maisho gaitu.<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Baacwa obwengye oku baraamukwate, ahakuba bakamanya ku nibo yaaba naarengyeza omu kucwa enfumu egyo; kwonka baatiina abantu, baamureka, baagyenda.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abafarisaayo okumutegyesa eby'omushoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:13-17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20:20-26</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22:15-22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi bakamutumaho abamwe aha Bafarisaayo n'aba Heroode kumutega omu bigambo. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Baija baamugira bati: Mwegyesa, nitumanya ku ori ow'amazima, kandi togwera rubaju rw'omuntu weena orutahikire, ahabw'okuba totiinisibwa kitiinisa ky'omuntu, kureka oyegyesa omuhanda gwa Ruhanga omu mazima. Ebiragiro nibiikiriza kuha Kaisaari omushoro, nari tikwo? <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Tushore, nari turereere? Kwonka ku yaamanyire oburyarya bwabo, yaabagira ati: Nimuntegyera ki? Mundeetere edenaari, ngireebe. <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Baagireeta. Yaababuuza ati: Ekishushani eki n'ebihandiikirweho n'eby'oha? Baamugarukamu bati: N'ebya Kaisaari. <verse eid="MRK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:7">Rom 13:7</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaabagira ati: Mbwenu nu ebya Kaisaari mubihe Kaisaari; n'ebya Ruhanga mubihe Ruhanga. Baamutangaarira munonga.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abasadukaayo okuhakanisa okuzooka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:18-27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 20:27-38">Luk 20:27-38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22:23-33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Abasadukaayo, abahakana ku hatariho kuzooka, baija ah'ari, baamubuuza bati: <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Bir 25:5</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 25:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Mwegyesa, Musa akatuhandiikira, yaatugira ati: Mwene ishe w'omuntu, ku arifa yaatsiga omukazi atakazaire nawe, omuntu ogwo ahungure ogwo mufaakazi, amumuzaarireho abaana. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Mbwenu hakaba hariho enyine-emwe mushanju; mukuru waabo akashwera omukazi; yaafa atakazaire nawe. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Omurumuna yaamuhungura, nawe yaafa atakazaire; n'owa kashatu atyo. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Boona omushanju baafa batakazaire nawe. Bwanyima omukazi ogwo nawe yaabakurata, yaafa. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Mbwenu omu kuzooka aryaba muka oha? Ahakuba boona omushanju bakamushwera. <verse eid="MRK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesu yaabagarukamu ati: Ekibahabisa t'okutamanya Byahandiikirwe, n'obu gaakuba amaani ga Ruhanga? <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Ahakuba omu kuzooka tibarishwera, kandi tibarishwerwa, kureka baryaba nka baamaraika ab'omu iguru. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:2">Kur 3:2</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 3:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Ebirikukwata aha by'okuzooka kw'abafu, timukashomaga omu kitabo kya Musa, Ruhanga oku yaamugambiire ari aha Rushaka, ati: Nyowe ndi Ruhanga wa Abrahamu, Ruhanga wa Isaaka, kandi Ruhanga wa Yakobo? <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Ruhanga ti Ruhanga w'abafu, kureka ow'abahuriire. Muhabire munonga.<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebiragiro ebirikukira ebindi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:28-34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 20:39">Luk 20:39</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 20:40">40</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mat 22:34-40</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi omwe aha bahandiiki yaija, yaahurira nibabuuzana; ku yaamanyire ngu yaabagarukamu gye, nawe yaamubuuza ati: Ekiragiro ekirikukira ebindi obukuru ni kiiha?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10:25-28</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:4">Bir 6:4</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 6:5">5</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaamugarukamu ati: Ekirikubikira n'ekirikugira kiti: Hurira, Israeli! Mukama Ruhanga waitu n'Omwe wenka; <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Okunde Mukama Ruhanga waawe n'omutima gwawe gwona, n'amagara gaawe goona, n'obwengye bwawe bwona, kandi n'amaani gaawe goona. <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref>. </char></note> Ekya kabiri n'ekirikugira kiti: Okunde mutaahi waawe nk'oku oyekunda. Tihariho kiragiro ekirikukira ebi. <verse eid="MRK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Omuhandiiki yaamugarukamu ati: Haza kwo, Mwegyesa, waagamba gye okugira oti, n'Omwe, kandi oti, Tihariho ondiijo kureka We wenka; <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:22">1 Sam 15:22</ref>. </char></note> kandi okumukunda n'omutima gwona, n'obwengye bwona, n'amaani goona, n'okukunda mutaahi waawe nk'oku oyekunda, ebi nibikira ebitambo byona ebyokyeize kimwe n'empongano. <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yesu ku yaahuriire yaamugarukamu n'okwetegyereza, yaamugira ati: Tori hare n'obukama bwa Ruhanga. Okuruga aho tihaine owaagarukire kumuturukirira kumubuuza.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omwana wa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:35-37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20:41-44</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22:41-46</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yesu ku yaabaire naayegyesa omuri hekalu, yaagira ati: Ahabw'enki abahandiiki bahamya ngu, Kristo n'Omwana wa Daudi? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Zab 110:1</ref>. </char></note> Haza Daudi we yaagambisiibwe Omwoyo Orikwera ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">Mukama akagambira Mukama wangye ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">Shutama aha rubaju rwangye rwa buryo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">Okuhitsya obu ndita abazigu baawe ahansi y'ebigyere byawe.<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Beitu shi, Daudi we wenka ku araabe amweta Mukama we, kandi naabaasa ata kuba omwana we? Omutwe gw'abantu ab'obutoosha gwamuhurira gushemereirwe.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okworeka ebibi by'abahandiiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:38-40: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luk 20:45-47</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:1-39">Mat 23:1-39</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu kwegyesa kwe akagamba ati: Mwerinde abahandiiki, abakunda kugyenda bajwaire ebijwaro biraingwa, n'okutangirirwa omu katare, <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />n'okushutama aha bitebe by'ekitiinisa omuri sinagogi, n'emyanya y'ekitiinisa omu magyenyi, <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />kandi abanyaga enju z'abafaakazi, bakarandagatana omu kushaba, haza nibaryarya. Abo baryacwerwa orubanja orurikukira obuhango.<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'omufaakazi omworo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:41-44: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luk 21:1-4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi yaashutama aharikureebana n'eibiikiro ry'ebiconco, yaareeba abantu baingi oku barikuritamu empiiha; baingi abaabaire bari abatungi baatamu nyingi. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Bwanyima haija omufaakazi omworo, yaatamu obwoma bubiri oburikwingana sente ibiri. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Yesu yaayeta abeegi be, yaabagira ati: Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Omufaakazi oriya omworo yaatamu bingi okukira bariya boona abaheereza ebiconco. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 8:9">2 Kor 8:9</ref>, <ref loc="2CO 8:12">12</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba abo boona baatamu aha bibashaagire; kwonka omufaakazi oriya yaatamu ebi aine byona, kandi niryo itungo rye heza.<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ebirikumanyisa okucwekyerera kwa Yerusaalemu n'okugaruka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:1-37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 21:5-36">Luk 21:5-36</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:1-51">Mat 24:1-51</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku yaarugire omuri hekalu, omwe aha beegi be yaamugira ati: Mwegyesa, reeba amabaare aga n'ebyombeko ebi ku biri eby'okutangaaza. <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yesu yaamugira ati: Nooreeba ebyombeko ebi ku biri bihango? Kwonka tihariho ibaare eriritsigara riri aha rindi eritarinagwa hansi.<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Ku yaabaire ashutami omu kibungo kya Zeituuni ahashungaine na hekalu, Petero na Yakobo na Yohaana na Anderea baamubuuza omu mubonano, nibagira bati: <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />Tugambire ebi ahu biribeeraho, kandi ni kamanyiso ki akaryoreka obunaku obu ebi byona birihikiirizibwamu? <verse eid="MRK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yesu yaatandika kubagarukamu ati: Mwerinde hatarigira omuntu weena owaabahabisa. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Baingi baryaija omu iziina ryangye nibagira bati: Niinye Kristo! Kandi baryahabisa baingi. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Ku murihurira engamba n'okurangaanwa kwazo, mutaritiina; ebyo bishemereire kubaho; kwonka emperu yo eryaba etakahikire. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 19:2">Isa 19:2</ref>. </char></note> Eihanga riryateera erindi ihanga, n'obugabe buryateera obundi bugabe; haryabaho emitsitsa omu myanya mingi, haryabaho n'enjara; ebyo niyo ntandikiro y'obusaasi.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:9-13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luk 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:17-22">Mat 10:17-22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka mwerinde; ahakuba baryabahayo omu mashengyero; muryateererwa omuri sinagogi; muryayemerera omu maisho g'abategyeki n'abagabe ahabwangye kuba baakareebi bangye omu maisho gaabo. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Kandi engiri eshemereire kubanza kubuurirwa omu mahanga goona. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Ku bariba nibabatwara omu manja, baabahayo, mutaryemereza omutima ahabw'ebi murigamba; ahakuba tiimwe muryegambisa kureka Omwoyo Orikwera. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mik 7:6</ref>. </char></note> Mukuru w'omuntu aryahayo omurumuna kwitwa, na ishe w'omwana aryahayo omwana we, abaana baryagomera abazaire baabo, babaitise; <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />kandi muryayangwa abantu boona nibabatura eiziina ryangye. Kwonka origumisiriza okuhitsya aha muheru, niwe arijunwa.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dan 9:27</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:4">12:4</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 12:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka ku murireeba ekintu ekirikuzira ekirikuhwerekyereza kyemereziibwe ahu kitashemereire, (orikushoma ayetegyereze,) abo abariba bari Buyudaaya omu bunaku obwo bahungire aha nshozi; <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />n'ori aha mutwe gw'enju ataritemburuka, n'obu kuriba okutaahamu, ngu agire eki yaihamu; <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />n'oriba ari omu misiri atarigarukayo kwenda omwenda gwe. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Abariba baine enda n'abarikwontsya omu biro ebyo baryakareeba! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Mushabe bitarihika mu biro by'embeho. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dan 12:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:2">Yoel 2:2</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba ebiro ebyo biryaba eby'obusaasi obutakabahoga okwiha aha kuhangwa kw'ebintu ebi Ruhanga yaahangire n'okuhitsya hati, kandi tibiribaho. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Kuri Mukama ataracwire ha biro ebyo, tihaakurokokireho muntu weena; kwonka ahabw'entoore ezi yaatooraine akatuubya aha biro ebyo. <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Omu biro ebyo omuntu weena ku aribagambira ati: Reeba, Kristo ari aha! Nari shi, ari hariya! Mutarimwikiriza; <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />ahakuba haryaimuka abarikweyeta Kristo na baanabi b'ebishuba, baryakora eby'okureeberaho n'eby'okutangaaza, babone kuhabisa n'entoore, kyaba nikibaasika. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Kwonka imwe mwerinde; naabagambira byona bitakahikire.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa 13:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi omu biro ebyo bwanyima y'obusaasi obwo, eizooba riryashwekwa omwirima, okwezi tikuryaka, <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:4">Isa 34:4</ref>. </char></note> enyonyoozi ziryaragara okuruga omu iguru, n'eby'amaani eby'omu iguru biryatengyetsibwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7:13</ref>. </char></note> Obwo nibwo barireeba Omwana w'omuntu naizira omu bicu, aine amaani maingi n'ekitiinisa. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Kandi aryatuma baamaraika be, ateerane entoore ze okuruga omu mbaju ina aha muheru gw'ensi, okuhika aha muheru gw'eiguru.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />Mbwenu mwegyere aha mutiini nk'eky'okureeberaho; eitaagi ryagwo, ku ryoroba, ryatooka amababi, mumanya omwaka ku guri haihi. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Nikwo naimwe, ku murireeba ebyo byagyenda nibibaho, mumanye ku ari haihi, ku yaahikire n'aha rwigi. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Obusingye obu tiburihwaho okuhitsya obu ebi byona biribaho. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Eiguru n'ensi biryahwaho, kwonka ebigambo byangye tibirihwaho.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />Kwonka eby'ekiro ekyo n'obunaku obwo tihaine orikubimanya, n'obu baakuba baamaraika ab'omu iguru, n'obu yaakuba Omwana, kureka Ishe wenka. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Mwerinde, mugume nimureeba, kandi mushabe, ahakuba timurikumanya ahu obunaku obwo burihikira. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:12">Luk 19:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:14">Mat 25:14</ref>. </char></note> Nikishusha nk'omuntu orikwenda kuza omu nsi endiijo; yaaba naaruga omu ka ye, atsiga aragiire abahuuku be emirimo, buri omwe amuha ogwe, n'omurinzi okurinda eka. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />N'ahabw'ekyo mugume nimureeba, ahabw'okuba timurikumanya bunaku obu mukama w'eka ariiziramu, yaaba mu mwabazyo, nari omu itumbi, nari enkoko nizigamba, nari omu kasheeshe, <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />atakaija kitaraariire, akashanga mugwejegyeire. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Eki ndikubagambira imwe, nikyo ngambira boona, nti: Mugume nimureeba!<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Abayuda okucuma enaama y'okwita Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1-2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26:1-5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwo hakaba hatsigaire ebiro bibiri okuhika aha Kuhingurwaho, n'aha bugyenyi obw'Emigaati etatumbisiibwe. Kandi abanyamurwa abakuru n'abahandiiki bakaba nibacwa obwengye oku baraamukwate kitamanyirwe, bakamwita; <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />kwonka baagira bati: Turekye kumukwatira omu bugyenyi, hatabaho okwimukirira omu bantu.<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:3-9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yoh 12:1-8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku yaabaire ari Besania omwa Simooni omubembe, ashutami naarya, haija omukazi oine eihembe ry'amajuta g'omugaju ag'obuguzi bwingi munonga; eihembe yaaryata, amajuta yaagashuka aha mutwe gwa Yesu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:36">Luk 7:36</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Abamwe aha baabaire bariho baaguubwa kubi, nibagira bati: Amajuta aga gaafa ki? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Nangwa kuri gaagurwamu edenaari ezirikushaaga magana ashatu, zikagabirwa abooro! Baamwetomboitera. <verse eid="MRK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Kwonka Yesu yaagira ati: Mumurekye; nimumugwisiza ki kubi? Eki yankorera ni kirungi; <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />ahabw'okuba abooro mutuura nabo obutoosha; nimubaasa kubakorera gye, mwaba nimwenda; kwonka nyowe timuriguma naanye obutoosha. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Yaakora nk'oku arikubaasa; yaabanza kunsiiga amajuta kuteekateeka omubiri gwangye, ntakaziikirwe. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Engiri ei erigambwa hoona omu nsi yoona, n'eki omukazi ogu yaakora kiryagambwayo kumwijuka.<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda okutunda Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:10-11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22:3-6</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26:14-16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Yuda Iskaryota, omwe ahari bari ikumi na babiri, yaaza ow'abanyamurwa abakuru ngu amubareebeze. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Ku baakihuriire, baashemererwa, baaraganisa kumuha empiiha. Nawe yaasherura oburyo bw'okumureebya.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu n'abeegi be okurya obugyenyi bw'Okuhingurwaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:12-16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luk 22:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:17-19">Mat 26:17-19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha kiro ky'okubanza ky'Emigaati etatumbisiibwe, ahu baabaire baheera ekitambo ky'omwana gw'entaama gw'Okuhingurwaho, abeegi be baamubuuza bati: Nooyenda tuze kukuteguurira hi, ei oraariire obugyenyi bw'Okuhingurwaho? <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Yaatuma babiri aha beegi be, yaabagira ati: Mwirooko muze omu rurembo, okwo nimwija kubuganayo omushaija, ayekoreire enjoga y'amaizi; mumukuratire; <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />enju ei araataahemu yoona, mugambire nyineeka muti: Omwegyesa yaakutumaho, naakubuuza ngu, Ekishengye ky'abagyenyi kiri nkahi, omu araariire Okuhingurwaho n'abeegi be? <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Naija kubooreka ekishengye kihango eky'ahaiguru ekicumirwe, ekirimu byona; mube nimwo mwatuteguurira. <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Batyo abeegi baagyenda, baataaha omu rurembo, baashanga biri nk'oku yaabagambira; baatebeekanisa Okuhinguraho.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:17-25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:14-23">Luk 22:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:20-29">Mat 26:20-29</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-26">Yoh 13:21-26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku bwaizire, yaija na bari ikumi na babiri. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Zab 41:9</ref>. </char></note> Ku baabaire nibarya, Yesu yaabagira ati: Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Omwe ahariimwe orikurya naanye naija kundeebya. <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Baatandika kushaasha bashobeirwe, baamubuuza omwe omwe nibagira bati: Niinye? <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Yaabagarukamu ati: N'omwe ahari aba ikumi na babiri orikukoza naanye omu rwabya. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Omwana w'omuntu naija kugyenda, nk'oku kyamuhandiikirweho, kwonka orikumureebya aryakareeba. Kikaabaire kirungi nangwa kuri atarazairwe.<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kor 11:23-25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku baabaire nibarya, yaakwata omugaati; ku yaaherize kusiima, yaagubega, yaagubaha naagira ati: Mwakiire; ogu nigwo mubiri gwangye. <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Yaakwata ekikopo; ku yaaherize kusiima, yaakibaha, boona baanywaho. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Kur 24:8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:11">Zek 9:11</ref>. </char></note> Yaabagira ati: Egi n'eshagama yangye ey'endagaano, esheesheka ahabwa baingi. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Tindinywa ha byana by'emizaabibu okuhitsya aha kiro ekyo, obu ndibinywa biri bisya omu bukama bwa Ruhanga.<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okugamba oku Petero araamwehakane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:26-31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:39">39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:30-35">Mat 26:30-35</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku baaherize kweshongora ekyeshongoro, baashohora, baaza omu kibungo kya Zeituuni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 113-118">Zab 113—118</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Zek 13:7</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Yesu yaabagira ati: Imwe mwena nimwija kumpemukaho; ahakuba nikwo kyahandiikirwe ngu, Ndyateera omuriisa, entaama zitaataane. <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Kwonka ku ndiheza kuzooka, ndyababandiza Galilaaya. <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Petero yaahiga naamugira ati: N'obu abandi boona baraakuhemukyeho, kwonka nyowe tindikwija kukuhemukaho. <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:38">Yoh 13:38</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaamugarukamu ati: Buzimazima ninkugambira nti: Iwe eki kiro enkoko etakashubiire, noija kuunyehakana kashatu. <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Kwonka Petero yaayeyongyera kuhigira kimwe ati: N'obu naakuba ow'okwitwa naiwe, tindikwija kukwehakana na kakye. N'abandi boona baagira batyo.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okushaba n'obusaasi omuri Gesesemaane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:32-42: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:40-46">Luk 22:40-46</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26:36-46</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima baahika omu mwanya ogurikwera Gesesemaane; Yesu yaagambira abeegi be ati: Mube mushutami aha, mbanze nshabe. <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Yaatwara Petero na Yakobo na Yohaana; yaatandika kugira obusaasi bwingi n'okushoberwa munonga. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:27">Yoh 12:27</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 43:5">Zab 43:5</ref>. </char></note> Yaabagira ati: Omutima gwangye gwine obusaasi bwingi bw'okuunyita; mugume aha nimureeba. <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Yairiraho kakye omu maisho, yaajuumara ahansi, yaashaba ngu, ku kiraabe nikibaasika, eshaaha egyo emuhingure. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Yaagira ati: <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abba, amakuru gaakyo ngu, Taata. </char></note>Abba, Taata, byona nibikubaasikira; onyiheho ekikopo eki; kwonka kitaba nk'oku nyowe ndikwenda, kureka nk'oku Iwe orikwenda. <verse eid="MRK 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Yaagaruka, yaashanga bagwejegyeire, yaabuuza Petero ati: Simooni, ogwejegyeire? Waaremwa kwehangaana kureeba nangwa n'eshaaha emwe? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Mureebe mushabe, murekye kugwa omu kwohibwa; omutima gwo nigukunda, kwonka omubiri n'omweremwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Yaakuba yaagarukayo, yaashaba ebigambo bimwe n'eby'okubanza. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Yaagaruka obwa kabiri, nabwo yaashanga bagwejegyeire, ahabw'okuba amaisho gaabo gakaba nigahungira, kandi tabaramanyire ki baraamugarukyemu. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Yaagaruka omurundi gwa kashatu, yaabagira ati: Na hati mukigwejegyeire, muhuumwire? Okwo nikumara; obunaku bwahika, Omwana w'omuntu, yaaza kuheebwayo omu mikono y'abasiisi. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Mwimukye, turugye aha; reba orikundeebya ari haihi.<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okukwata Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:43-54: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:47-55">Luk 22:47-55</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:47-58">Mat 26:47-58</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:2-18">Yoh 18:2-18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahonaaho ku yaabaire naakigamba, Yuda omwe ahari bari ikumi na babiri yaija n'omutwe gw'abantu baine zaarurara n'ebikoni, batumirwe abanyamurwa abakuru n'abahandiiki n'abakuru b'abantu. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Kandi obwo owaabaire naamureebya akaba abahaire akamanyiso naagira ati: Ou ndaanywegyere, niwe ogwo, mumukwate, mumutware nimumurinda. <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Ku yaizire, ahonaaho yaamuhikaho, yaagira ati: <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:45 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Rabbi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amakuru gaakyo ngu Mwegyesa. </char></note>Rabbi! Yaamunywegyera. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Baamugurukira, baamukwata. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Omwe aha baabaire beemereire aho yaasyorayo rurara ye, yaatema omuhuuku w'omunyamurwa omukuru, yaamucwaho okutu. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yesu yaababuuza ati: Mwampururira kunkwata na zaarurara n'ebikoni, nk'oku bahururira omwambuzi? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Ebiro byona nkaba ntuura naimwe, nimbeegyesa omuri hekalu, timurankwatsire. Kwonka eki kyabaho, ngu Ebyahandiikirwe bihikiirire. <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Okuruga aho abeegi be boona baamuhungaho, bairuka. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Kandi omutsigazi omwe yaamukuratira ajwaire omwenda gwa kitaani gwonka; nawe baamukwata; <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />yaatsiga ogwo mwenda gwa kitaani, yaahunga ajwaire busha.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abanyamurwa okucwera Yesu orubanja rw'okumwita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Okuruga aho baatwara Yesu aha munyamurwa omukuru; baashanga abanyamurwa abakuru n'abakuru b'abantu n'abahandiiki bateeraniireyo. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Obwo Petero akaba amukuratiire naamugyenda hare, yaataaha omu kibuga ky'omunyamurwa omukuru, yaashutama n'abarinzi, yaayota omuriro. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:55-65: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">Luk 22:63-71</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:59-68">Mat 26:59-68</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yoh 18:19-24</ref>. </char></note> Kandi abanyamurwa abakuru n'ab'omu ishengyero boona baasherura obwamushinja ngu baite Yesu, tibaabubona. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />N'obu abaamubeihereire baabaire bari baingi, kwonka obwamushinja bwabo tiburashushaine. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Abamwe baimuka, baamubeiherera nibagira bati: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:58: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:19">Yoh 2:19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:21">4:21</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 4:23">23</ref>. </char></note> Itwe tukamuhurira naagira ati: Ndyasheenya hekalu egi eyaayombekirwe emikono, kandi omu biro bishatu nyombekye endiijo etombekirwe mikono. <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Obwamushinja bwabo obwo nabwo tibwashushana. <verse eid="MRK 14:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Omunyamurwa omukuru nikwo kwemerera ahagati yaabo, akabuuza Yesu ati: Toine ki orikwetonganira na kakye? Aba nibakwomesereza ki? <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:61: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 15:5">Mak 15:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 53:7">Isa 53:7</ref>. </char></note> We yaahunama, tiyaagira ki yaamugarukamu. Omunyamurwa omukuru yaagaruka yaamubuuza ati: Niiwe Kristo, Omwana w'Ogwo orikusiimwa? <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yesu yaagarukamu ati: Ndi We; naimwe muryareeba Omwana w'omuntu ashutami aha rubaju rwa buryo rw'Obushoboorozi, naizira omu bicu by'omu iguru. <verse eid="MRK 14:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Omunyamurwa omukuru yaataagura ebijwaro bye naagira ati: Kandi nitukyendera ki baamushinja abandi? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:64: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:7">Yoh 19:7</ref>. </char></note> Naimwe mwayehuririra okurogota kwe! Mbwenu nimuteekateeka muta? Boona baamucwera orubanja ngu ashemereire kufa. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Abamwe baatandika kumucwera amacwante, n'okumushweka omwenda aha maisho, n'okumuteera entomi, nibamugira bati: Ragura owaakuteera! N'abambari baamwakiira, bamuhikize aha mpi.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero okumwehakana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:66-72: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mat 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">Yoh 18:25-27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Petero ku yaabaire ari ahansi omu kibuga, omwe aha bazaana b'omunyamurwa omukuru yaija, <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />yaareeba Petero naayota; yaamwetegyereza, yaamugira ati: Naiwe obaire ori hamwe na Yesu owa Nazareesi. <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Yaayehakana naagira ati: Tindikumanya ki orikugamba, n'obu kwakuba okukyetegyereza. Yaarugayo, yaaza omu irembo. <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Omuzaana ogwo yaamureeba, yaagaruka yaagambira abaabaire beemereireho ati: Omushaija ogwo n'omwe aharibo. <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Petero yaagaruka yaayehakana. Ku haahingwireho akaanya kakye, abaabaire beemereire aho baagaruka baagira Petero bati: Buzima kwo ori omwe aharibo, ahabw'okuba ori Omunyagalilaaya. <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />We yaatandika kukyeena n'okurahira, naagira ati: Omuntu ogwo ou murikungambaho, tindikumumanya. <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Ahonaaho enkoko yaashubiira. Petero yaijuka ekigambo eki Yesu amugambiire ati: Enkoko etakashubiire, noija kuunyehakana kashatu. Ku yaijukire ekyo, yaarira.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu okutwarwa owa Pilaato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Kandi ku bwabaire nibutaagurikana, abanyamurwa abakuru hamwe n'abakuru b'abantu n'abahandiiki n'ab'omu ishengyero boona, baaza omu naama; bwanyima baaboha Yesu, baamutwara, baamuhayo ahari Pilaato. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2-19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:2-25">Luk 23:2-25</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:11-30">Mat 27:11-30</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:29-19:16">Yoh 18:29—19:16</ref>. </char></note> Pilaato yaamubuuza ati: Weeza ori Omugabe w'Abayudaaya? Yaamugarukamu ati: Eki waagamba nikwo kiri. <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Abanyamurwa abakuru baamutabaariza bingi. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Pilaato yaagaruka yaamubuuza ati: Toine ki orikwetonganira na kakye? Ka baakutabaariza bingi! <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Nabwo Yesu tiyaagarukamu; n'ahabw'ekyo Pilaato yaatangaara.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pilaato okucwera Yesu orubanja rw'okubambwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Kandi aha bugyenyi nk'obwo akaba amanyiire kubarekurira embohe yoona ei baabaire bamushaba. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Kandi omu baagomire bakaita abantu, abaabaire babohirwe omu kihome ahabw'obugomi obwo, hakaba harimu omushaija orikwetwa Barabba. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Abantu baingi baija baatandika kushaba Pilaato kubagirira nk'oku ashangwa abagirira. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Yaabagarukamu ati: Nimwenda ngu mbarekurire Omugabe w'Abayudaaya? <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:48">Yoh 11:48</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba akamanya ku abanyamurwa abakuru baamuhayo ahabw'eihari. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Kwonka abanyamurwa abakuru baashunika engabo z'abantu kugamba bati: Haakiri Barabba obe niwe waaturekurira. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilaato yaagaruka yaababuuza ati: Mbwenu shi, ngire nta Ogu ou murikweta Omugabe w'Abayudaaya? <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Baagaruka baayomba munonga bati: Mubambe aha musharaba! <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilaato yaababuuza ati: Ahanki? Ni kibi ki eki akozire? Baayeyongyera kuyomba munonga bati: Mubambe! <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilaato ahabw'okwenda kunanura ezo ngabo, yaabarekurira Barabba; ku yaaherize kwasha Yesu, yaamuhayo kubambwa.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Bwanyima abaserukare baamutwara, baamutaasya omu kibuga ekirikwetwa Puratorio; baayeta omutwe gwona gwabaserukare. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Baamujweka omwenda gwa bujwa, baaruka ekirunga ky'amahwa, baakimujweka. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Baatandika kumutangirira nibagira bati: Singa, Mugabe w'Abayudaaya! <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Baamuhondesa ekibingo omu mutwe, baamucwera amacwante, baamutsimbira amaju nibamuramya. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20-41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:26-49">Luk 23:26-49</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:31-56">Mat 27:31-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16-30">Yoh 19:16-30</ref>. </char></note> Ku baaherize kumuteerera enaku, baamujuura ogwo mwenda, baamujweka ebijwaro bye. Baamushohoza, baaza kumubamba.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okubambwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 16:13">Rom 16:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baayemereza omuhinguzi owaabaire naaruga omu kyaro, orikwetwa Simooni owa Kureene, ishe wa Alegizanda na Rufo, baamugyema kwekorera omusharaba gwa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Baatwara Yesu aharikwetwa Gologosa, (ekirikumanyisa ngu, Omwanya gw'empanga y'omutwe). <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Zab 69:21</ref>. </char></note> Baamuha viinyo ejwangizemu omubazi ogurikwetwa <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sumuruna n'omubazi ogurikutuubya obusaasi, ogujwangibwa omu majuta g'okushoroora, ogwomya emitumbi, n'ebindi. </char></note>sumuruna; yaayanga kuginywa. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Zab 22:18</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima baamubamba aha musharaba; baabagana ebijwaro bye nibabiteerera enteenyu, ngu bamanye buri muntu eki araatware. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Baamubamba aha shaaha ya kashatu. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Ekirangiriro ky'ebi baamurega baakihanika ahaiguru ye, ekihandiikirwe ngu, OMUGABE W'ABAYUDAAYA. <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Kandi baamubamba hamwe n'abambuzi babiri, omwe aha rubaju rwe rwa buryo, n'ondiijo aha rwa bumosho. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Nikwo Ebyahandiikirwe byahikiriziibwe bityo ebirikugira ngu, Akabarirwa hamwe n'abasiisi. <verse eid="MRK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:7">Zab 22:7</ref>. </char></note> Abaabaire nibahinguraho baamuteerera enaku, nibazongoza emitwe, nibagira bati: Iwe orikusheenya hekalu okagyombekyera ebiro bishatu, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />yejune, ohanukye orugye aha musharaba. <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Kandi n'abanyamurwa abakuru nikwo baamuteereire batyo enaku, nibagambirana n'abahandiiki bati: Akajuna abandi; tarikubaasa kwejuna. <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Kristo, Omugabe wa Israeli, naarugye hati mbwenu aha musharaba, tukireebe twikirize. Kandi abaabambiirwe hamwe nawe nabo baamuteerera enaku.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okufa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:33: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 8:9">Amo 8:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eshaaha ya mukaaga ku yaahikire, omwirima gwashweka ensi yoona okuhitsya aha shaaha ya mwenda. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:1">Zab 22:1</ref>. </char></note> Aha shaaha egyo eya mwenda, Yesu yaagamba n'eiraka rihango ati: Eloi, Eloi, lama sabakasaani, amakuru gaakyo ngu, Ruhanga wangye, Ruhanga wangye, n'enki ekyakuntsigisaho? <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Kandi abamwe aha baabaire beemereire aho, ku baakihuriire, baagira bati: Hurira, naayeta Eliya! <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Zab 69:21</ref>. </char></note> Omwe yairuka, yaajabika ekyangu omuri viinyo erikushaarira, yaakita aha kibingo, yaamuheereza kunywa, naagira ati: Reka tureebe Eliya ku araabe naija kumuhanura. <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Yesu yaagamba n'eiraka rihango, yaahayo amagara ge. <verse eid="MRK 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Omukingo gw'omuri hekalu gwataagukamu ebicweka bibiri okuruga aha mutwe gwagwo okuhika ahansi. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Kandi omukuru w'abaserukare akaba ayemereire naamureeba; ku yaareebire yaahayo amagara ge atyo, yaagira ati: Buzima kwo omuntu ogu yaaba ori Omwana wa Ruhanga.<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Hakaba hariho n'abakazi beemereire nibareebera hangahari; omuri abo hakaba harimu Mariamu Magadaleene, na Mariamu nyina wa Yakobo omuto na Yose, na Saalome; <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />abo nibo baabaire bamukuratira, nibamuheereza, akiri Galilaaya; kandi hakaba hariho n'abandi bakazi baingi abaagyenzire nawe Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuziika Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:42-47: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 23:50-55">Luk 23:50-55</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoh 19:38-42</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwabazyo, nk'oku ryabaire riri eizooba ry'Okweteguura, kandi riri eizooba eririkubandiza Sabato, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Yosefu owa Arimasaaya, omuhanuuzi w'ekitiinisa omu ishengyero, kandi owaabaire atuura ategyereize obukama bwa Ruhanga, yaatiinuuka, yaataaha owa Pilaato, yaashaba omutumbi gwa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilaato yaatangaarira oku yaarahuka kukaba; yaatuma kweta omukuru w'abaserukare, yaamubuuza ku araabe yaakabire. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Ku yaahamiziibwe omukuru w'abaserukare ku yaaheza kukaba, yaikiriza kuha Yosefu omutumbi. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Yosefu yaagura omwenda gwa bafuta, yaahanura omutumbi, yaaguzinga omu mwenda ogwo gwa bafuta, yaaguta omu kituuro, ekyatimbirwe omu rukiri; yaakumbagaza eibaare, yaarikingisa omuryango gw'ekituuro. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Kandi Mariamu Magadaleene na Mariamu nyina wa Yose baayetegyereza ahu omutumbi gwe gwateebwa.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Okuzooka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:1-8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoh 20:1-10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Sabato ku yaahweireho, Mariamu Magadaleene na Mariamu nyina wa Yakobo na Saalome baagura eby'emigaju, ngu baije bamusiigye. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Omu kasheeshe munonga aha kiro ky'okubanza omu saabiiti baahika aha kituuro, eizooba ryaturukire, <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />nibabuuzana bati: N'oha oraatukumbagarize eibaare okuruga aha muryango gw'ekituuro? <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Ku baanagire amaisho, baareeba eibaare rikumbagaziibwe hangahari; ahakuba rikaba riri rihango munonga. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Ku baataahire omu kituuro, baareeba omutsigazi ashutami aha rubaju rwa buryo, ajwaire omwenda gurikwera; baatangaara. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Yaabagambira ati: Mutatangaara; nimusherura Yesu owa Nazareesi obambirwe. Yaazooka, tari aha; mureebe n'omwanya ahu babaire bamutaire. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Mbwenu mwirooko mugyende, mugambire abeegi be na Petero ngu, abeebembeire kuza Galilaaya; okwo niyo muraamushangye, nk'oku yaabagambiire. <verse eid="MRK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Baashohora, baaruga aha kituuro nibahunga, ahakuba bakakwatwa orutetema n'okutangaara; kandi tibaine u bakigambiire, ahabw'okuba bakaba batiinire.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okweyoreka abeegi be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yoh 20:11-18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yesu ku yaazookire omu kasheeshe aha izooba ry'okubanza omuri saabiiti, yaabanza kweyoreka Mariamu Magadaleene, ou yaabingireho baadaimoni mushanju. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />We yaagyenda, yaagambira abu Yesu yaabaire atuura nabo, yaashanga nibaganya, nibarira. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Kandi ku baagambiirwe ngu ariho ahuriire, kandi ngu yaareebwa Mariamu, tibaakiikiriza. <verse eid="MRK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luk 24:13-35</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima y'ekyo yaayeyoreka omu nshusha endiijo aha bandi babiri aharibo, abaabaire nibagyenda nibaza omu kyaro. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Abo nabo baagaruka Yerusaalemu, baabigambira abeegi abandi; nabo tibaabaikiriza.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:14-18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoh 20:19-23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima yaayeyoreka ahari ikumi n'omwe, bari bonka nibarya, yaabahana ahabw'okutaikiriza kwabo n'obugangaazi bw'emitima yaabo, ahakuba tibaraikiriize bi baagambiirwe abaamureebire yaaheza kuzooka.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:5">1 Kor 15:5</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Yaabagira ati: Mugyende omu nsi zoona, mubuurire engiri ebihangirwe byona. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:38">Byak 2:38</ref>. </char></note> Oriikiriza akabatizibwa, aryajunwa; kwonka otariikiriza, aryasingwa orubanja. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:18">Byak 16:18</ref>. </char></note> Obumanyiso oburiguma nibureebwa omu barikwikiriza n'obu: omu iziina ryangye baryabinga baadaimoni, baryagamba endimi nsya; <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:19">Luk 10:19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 28:3-6">Byak 28:3-6</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 5:14">Yak 5:14</ref>, <ref loc="JAS 5:15">15</ref>. </char></note> baryakwata enjoka, kandi ku barinywa ekirikwita kyona, tikiribarwaza; baryata engaro aha barwaire, bakire.<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luk 24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:4-11">Byak 1:4-11</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:55">7:55</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Mukama waitu Yesu, ku yaaherize kugamba nabo, yaatwarwa omu iguru, yaashutama aha rubaju rwa buryo rwa Ruhanga. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Nabo baashohora, baagyenda hoona hoona nibabuurira ekigambo kya Ruhanga, Mukama waitu ari hamwe nabo naabakwatsa, kandi naahamya ekigambo ekyo n'obumanyiso obwabaire bukikomookaho.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>